BIBLIA.receive({"no":35,"engs":"Hab","dir":"Hab","ab":"哈","zh":"哈巴谷書","en":"Habakkuk","t":"OT","nch":3,"ch":[{"c":1,"v":[{"s":1,"t":{"zh_unv":"先知哈巴谷所得的默示。","en_kjv":"The burden which Habakkuk the prophet did see.","en_web":"The oracle which Habakkuk the prophet saw.","es_rvr1909":"LA carga que vió Habacuc profeta.","es_rvc":"Profecía y visión del profeta Habacuc.","fr_nbs":"Sentence. Ce qu’Habacuc, le prophète, a vu.","ja_jp":"預言者ハバククが見た神の託宣。","ko_kor":"선지자 하박국의 묵시로 받은 경고라","vi_vie":"Nầy là gánh nặng mà đấng tiên tri Ha-ba-cúc đã xem thấy.","he_wlc":"הַמַּשָׂא֙ אֲשֶׁ֣ר חָזָ֔ה חֲבַקּ֖וּק הַנָּבִֽיא ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"先知","s":["H5030"]},{"w":"哈巴谷","s":["H2265"]},{"w":"所","s":["H834"]},{"w":"得","s":["H2372"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"的默示","s":["H4853"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"The burden","s":["H4853"]},{"w":"which Habakkuk","s":["H2265"]},{"w":"the prophet","s":["H5030"]},{"w":"did see","s":["H2372"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"הַמַּשָׂא֙","s":["H4853"]},{"w":"אֲשֶׁ֣ר","s":["H834"]},{"w":"חָזָ֔ה","s":["H2372"]},{"w":"חֲבַקּ֖וּק","s":["H2265"]},{"w":"הַנָּבִֽיא","s":["H5030"]},{"w":"׃"}]}},{"s":2,"t":{"zh_unv":"他說：耶和華啊！我呼求你，你不應允，要到幾時呢？我因強暴哀求你，你還不拯救。","en_kjv":"O LORD, how long shall I cry, and thou wilt not hear! even cry out unto thee of violence, and thou wilt not save!","en_web":"Yahweh, how long will I cry, and you will not hear? I cry out to you \"Violence!\" and will you not save?","es_rvr1909":"¿Hasta cuándo, oh Jehová, clamaré, y no oirás; y daré voces á ti á causa de la violencia, y no salvarás?","es_rvc":"¿Hasta cuándo, Señor, te llamaré y no me harás caso? ¿Hasta cuándo clamaré a ti por causa de la violencia, y no vendrás a salvarnos?","fr_nbs":"— Jusqu’à quand, SEIGNEUR, appellerai-je au secours sans que tu entendes ? Jusqu’à quand crierai-je vers toi : « Violence ! » sans que tu sauves ?","ja_jp":"主よ、わたしが呼んでいるのに、いつまであなたは聞きいれて下さらないのか。わたしはあなたに「暴虐がある」と訴えたが、あなたは助けて下さらないのか。","ko_kor":"여호와여 ! 내가 부르짖어도 주께서 듣지 아니하시니 어느 때까지리이까 ? 내가 강포를 인하여 외쳐도 주께서 구원치 아니하시나이다","vi_vie":"Hỡi Đức Giê-hô-va! Tôi kêu van mà Ngài không nghe tôi cho đến chừng nào? Tôi vì sự bạo ngược kêu van cùng Ngài, mà Ngài chẳng khứng giải cứu tôi!","he_wlc":"עַד ־ אָ֧נָה יְהוָ֛ה שִׁוַּ֖עְתִּי וְלֹ֣א תִשְׁמָ֑ע אֶזְעַ֥ק אֵלֶ֛יךָ חָמָ֖ס וְלֹ֥א תוֹשִֽׁיעַ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"他說：耶和華","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"啊！我呼求","s":["H7768"],"m":["8765"]},{"w":"你，你不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"應允","s":["H8085"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"要到","s":["H5704"]},{"w":"幾時呢","s":["H575"]},{"w":"？"},{"w":"我因強暴","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"哀求","s":["H2199"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"你","s":["H413"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"你還不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"拯救","s":["H3467"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"O LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"w":","},{"w":"how long shall I cry","s":["H7768"],"m":["8765"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and thou wilt not hear","s":["H8085"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"!"},{"w":"even cry out","s":["H2199"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"unto thee of violence","s":["H2555"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and thou wilt not save","s":["H3467"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"!"}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"עַד","s":["H5704"]},{"w":"־ אָ֧נָה","s":["H575"]},{"w":"יְהוָ֛ה","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"שִׁוַּ֖עְתִּי","s":["H7768"]},{"w":"וְלֹ֣א","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"תִשְׁמָ֑ע","s":["H8085"]},{"w":"אֶזְעַ֥ק","s":["H2199"]},{"w":"אֵלֶ֛יךָ","s":["H413"]},{"w":"חָמָ֖ס","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"וְלֹ֥א","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"תוֹשִֽׁיעַ","s":["H3467"]},{"w":"׃"}]}},{"s":3,"t":{"zh_unv":"你為何使我看見罪孽？你為何看著奸惡而不理呢？毀滅和強暴在我面前，又起了爭端和相鬥的事。","en_kjv":"Why dost thou shew me iniquity, and cause me to behold grievance? for spoiling and violence are before me: and there are that raise up strife and contention.","en_web":"Why do you show me iniquity, and look at perversity? For destruction and violence are before me. There is strife, and contention rises up.","es_rvr1909":"¿Por qué me haces ver iniquidad, y haces que mire molestia, y saco y violencia delante de mí, habiendo además quien levante pleito y contienda?","es_rvc":"¿Por qué permites que vea yo iniquidad? ¿Por qué me haces espectador del mal? ¡Solo veo destrucción y violencia! ¡Ante mis ojos surgen pleitos y contiendas!","fr_nbs":"Pourquoi me fais-tu voir le mal et regardes-tu l’oppression ? Ravage et violence sont devant moi, il y a des querelles, et la dispute s’élève.","ja_jp":"あなたは何ゆえ、わたしによこしまを見せ、何ゆえ、わたしに災を見せられるのか。略奪と暴虐がわたしの前にあり、また論争があり、闘争も起っている。","ko_kor":"어찌하여 나로 간악을 보게 하시며 패역을 목도하게 하시나이까 ? 대저 겁탈과 강포가 내 앞에 있고 변론과 분쟁이 일어났나이다","vi_vie":"Nhơn sao Chúa khiến tôi thấy sự gian ác, và Ngài nhìn xem sự ngang trái? Sự tàn hại bạo ngược ở trước mặt tôi; sự tranh đấu cãi lẫy dấy lên.","he_wlc":"לָ֣מָּה תַרְאֵ֤נִי אָ֨וֶן֙ וְעָמָ֣ל תַּבִּ֔יט וְשֹׁ֥ד וְחָמָ֖ס לְנֶגְדִּ֑י וַיְהִ֧י רִ֦יב וּמָד֖וֹן יִשָּֽׂא ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"你為何","s":["H9001","H4100"]},{"w":"使我看見","s":["H7200"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"罪孽","s":["H205"]},{"w":"？"},{"w":"你為何看著","s":["H5027"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"奸惡","s":["H5999"]},{"w":"而不理呢？毀滅","s":["H7701"]},{"w":"和強暴","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"在我面前","s":["H9001","H5048"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"又","s":["H1961"]},{"w":"起了","s":["H5375"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"爭端","s":["H7379"]},{"w":"和相鬥","s":["H4066"]},{"w":"的事。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Why dost thou shew","s":["H7200"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"me iniquity","s":["H205"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and cause me to behold","s":["H5027"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"grievance","s":["H5999"]},{"w":"?"},{"w":"for spoiling","s":["H7701"]},{"w":"and violence","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"are before me: and there are that raise up","s":["H5375"],"m":["8799"],"i":1},{"w":"strife","s":["H7379"]},{"w":"and contention","s":["H4066"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"לָ֣מָּה","s":["H4100"]},{"w":"תַרְאֵ֤נִי","s":["H7200"]},{"w":"אָ֨וֶן֙","s":["H205"]},{"w":"וְעָמָ֣ל","s":["H5999"]},{"w":"תַּבִּ֔יט","s":["H5027"]},{"w":"וְשֹׁ֥ד","s":["H7701"]},{"w":"וְחָמָ֖ס","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"לְנֶגְדִּ֑י","s":["H5048"]},{"w":"וַיְהִ֧י","s":["H1961"]},{"w":"רִ֦יב","s":["H7379"]},{"w":"וּמָד֖וֹן","s":["H4066"]},{"w":"יִשָּֽׂא","s":["H5375"]},{"w":"׃"}]}},{"s":4,"t":{"zh_unv":"因此律法放鬆，公理也不顯明；惡人圍困義人，所以公理顯然顛倒。","en_kjv":"Therefore the law is slacked, and judgment doth never go forth: for the wicked doth compass about the righteous; therefore wrong judgment proceedeth.","en_web":"Therefore the law is paralyzed, and justice never goes forth; for the wicked surround the righteous; therefore justice goes forth perverted.","es_rvr1909":"Por lo cual la ley es debilitada, y el juicio no sale verdadero: por cuanto el impío asedia al justo, por eso sale torcido el juicio.","es_rvc":"Por eso tu ley carece de fuerza, y la justicia no se aplica con verdad. Por eso los impíos asedian a los justos, y se tuerce la justicia.","fr_nbs":"C’est pourquoi la loi est paralysée, et l’équité ne s’impose jamais ; parce que le méchant assaille le juste, c’est pour cela que l’équité est pervertie avant de pouvoir s’imposer.","ja_jp":"それゆえ、律法はゆるみ、公義は行われず、悪人は義人を囲み、公義は曲げて行われている。","ko_kor":"이러므로 율법이 해이하고 공의가 아주 시행되지 못하오니 이는 악인이 의인을 에워쌌으므로 공의가 굽게 행함이니이다","vi_vie":"Vậy nên luật pháp không quyền, sự chánh trực không hề tỏ ra. Kẻ hung ác vây chung quanh ngươi công bình, vì cớ đó sự xét đoán ra trái ngược.","he_wlc":"עַל ־ כֵּן֙ תָּפ֣וּג תּוֹרָ֔ה וְלֹֽא ־ יֵצֵ֥א לָנֶ֖צַח מִשְׁפָּ֑ט כִּ֤י רָשָׁע֙ מַכְתִּ֣יר אֶת ־ הַצַּדִּ֔יק עַל ־ כֵּ֛ן יֵצֵ֥א מִשְׁפָּ֖ט מְעֻקָּֽל ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"因","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"此","s":["H3651"]},{"w":"律法","s":["H8451"]},{"w":"放鬆","s":["H6313"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"公理","s":["H4941"]},{"w":"也不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"顯明","s":["H3318","H9001","H5331"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"；","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"惡人","s":["H7563"]},{"w":"圍困","s":["H3803","H853"],"m":["8688"]},{"w":"義人","s":["H6662"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"所以","s":["H5921","H3651"]},{"w":"公理","s":["H4941"]},{"w":"顯然","s":["H3318"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"顛倒","s":["H6127"],"m":["8794"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Therefore the law","s":["H8451"]},{"w":"is slacked","s":["H6313"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and judgment","s":["H4941"]},{"w":"doth never","s":["H5331"]},{"w":"go forth","s":["H3318"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"for the wicked","s":["H7563"]},{"w":"doth compass","s":["H3803"],"m":["8688"]},{"w":"about the righteous","s":["H6662"]},{"w":";"},{"w":"therefore wrong","s":["H6127"],"m":["8794"]},{"w":"judgment","s":["H4941"]},{"w":"proceedeth","s":["H3318"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"עַל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"־ כֵּן֙","s":["H3651"]},{"w":"תָּפ֣וּג","s":["H6313"]},{"w":"תּוֹרָ֔ה","s":["H8451"]},{"w":"וְלֹֽא","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"־ יֵצֵ֥א","s":["H3318"]},{"w":"לָנֶ֖צַח","s":["H5331"]},{"w":"מִשְׁפָּ֑ט","s":["H4941"]},{"w":"כִּ֤י","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"רָשָׁע֙","s":["H7563"]},{"w":"מַכְתִּ֣יר","s":["H3803"]},{"w":"אֶת","s":["H853"]},{"w":"־ הַצַּדִּ֔יק","s":["H6662"]},{"w":"עַל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"־ כֵּ֛ן","s":["H3651"]},{"w":"יֵצֵ֥א","s":["H3318"]},{"w":"מִשְׁפָּ֖ט","s":["H4941"]},{"w":"מְעֻקָּֽל","s":["H6127"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["wrong: or, wrested"]},"p":1},{"s":5,"t":{"zh_unv":"耶和華說：你們要向列國中觀看，大大驚奇；因為在你們的時候，我行一件事，雖有人告訴你們，你們總是不信。","en_kjv":"Behold ye among the heathen, and regard, and wonder marvellously: for I will work a work in your days, which ye will not believe, though it be told you .","en_web":"\"Look among the nations, watch, and wonder marvelously; for I am working a work in your days, which you will not believe though it is told you.","es_rvr1909":"Mirad en las gentes, y ved, y maravillaos pasmosamente; porque obra será hecha en vuestros días, que aun cuando se os contare, no la creeréis.","es_rvc":"«Miren entre las naciones, y vean, y asómbrense. Yo voy a hacer en sus días algo, a lo que ustedes no darán crédito, aunque se les cuente.","fr_nbs":"— Voyez, regardez parmi les nations, soyez dans la stupéfaction et la stupeur, car une œuvre est en train de s’accomplir que vous ne croiriez pas si on la racontait.","ja_jp":"諸国民のうちを望み見て、驚け、そして怪しめ。わたしはあなたがたの日に一つの事をする。人がこの事を知らせても、あなたがたはとうてい信じまい。","ko_kor":"여호와께서 가라사대 너희는 열국을 보고 또 보고 놀라고 또 놀랄지어다 너희 생전에 내가 한 일을 행할 것이라 혹이 너희에게 고할지라도 너희가 믿지 아니하리라","vi_vie":"Hãy nhìn trong các nước và xem, hãy lấy làm lạ và sững sờ! Vì ta đang làm ra trong ngày các ngươi một việc, mà dầu có ai thuật lại cho ngươi, các ngươi cũng không tin.","he_wlc":"רְא֤וּ בַגּוֹיִם֙ וְֽהַבִּ֔יטוּ וְהִֽתַּמְּה֖וּ תְּמָ֑הוּ כִּי ־ פֹ֨עַל֙ פֹּעֵ֣ל בִּֽימֵיכֶ֔ם לֹ֥א תַאֲמִ֖ינוּ כִּ֥י יְסֻפָּֽר ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"耶和華說：你們要向列國中","s":["H9002","H1471"]},{"w":"觀","s":["H7200"],"m":["8798"]},{"w":"看","s":["H5027"],"m":["8685"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"大大","s":["H8539"],"m":["8798"]},{"w":"驚奇","s":["H8539"],"m":["8690"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"因為","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"在你們的時候","s":["H9002","H3117"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"我行","s":["H6466"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"一件事","s":["H6467"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"雖","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"有人告訴","s":["H5608"],"m":["8792"]},{"w":"你們，你們總是不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"信","s":["H539"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Behold","s":["H7200"],"m":["8798"]},{"w":"ye among the heathen","s":["H1471"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and regard","s":["H5027"],"m":["8685"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and wonder","s":["H8539"],"m":["8690"]},{"w":"marvellously","s":["H8539"],"m":["8798"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"for I will work","s":["H6466"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"a work","s":["H6467"]},{"w":"in your days","s":["H3117"]},{"w":","},{"w":"which ye will not believe","s":["H539"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":","},{"w":"though it be told","s":["H5608"],"m":["8792"]},{"w":"you .","i":1}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"רְא֤וּ","s":["H7200"]},{"w":"בַגּוֹיִם֙","s":["H1471"]},{"w":"וְֽהַבִּ֔יטוּ","s":["H5027"]},{"w":"וְהִֽתַּמְּה֖וּ","s":["H8539"]},{"w":"תְּמָ֑הוּ","s":["H8539"]},{"w":"כִּי","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"־ פֹ֨עַל֙","s":["H6467"]},{"w":"פֹּעֵ֣ל","s":["H6466"]},{"w":"בִּֽימֵיכֶ֔ם","s":["H3117"]},{"w":"לֹ֥א","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"תַאֲמִ֖ינוּ","s":["H539"]},{"w":"כִּ֥י","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"יְסֻפָּֽר","s":["H5608"]},{"w":"׃"}]}},{"s":6,"t":{"zh_unv":"我必興起迦勒底人，就是那殘忍暴躁之民，通行遍地，佔據那不屬自己的住處。","en_kjv":"For, lo, I raise up the Chaldeans, that bitter and hasty nation, which shall march through the breadth of the land, to possess the dwellingplaces that are not theirs.","en_web":"For, behold, I raise up the Chaldeans, that bitter and hasty nation, that march through the breadth of the earth, to possess dwelling places that are not theirs.","es_rvr1909":"Porque he aquí, yo levanto los Caldeos, gente amarga y presurosa, que camina por la anchura de la tierra para poseer las habitaciones ajenas.","es_rvc":"Estoy por hacer que vengan los caldeos, un pueblo cruel y tenaz que recorre toda la tierra para adueñarse de los territorios de otros pueblos.","fr_nbs":"Je suscite les Chaldéens, ce peuple impitoyable et impétueux qui traverse de vastes pays pour prendre possession de demeures qui ne lui appartiennent pas.","ja_jp":"見よ、わたしはカルデヤびとを興す。これはたけく、激しい国民であって、地を縦横に行きめぐり、自分たちのものでないすみかを奪う。","ko_kor":"보라, 내가 사납고 성급한 백성 곧 땅의 넓은 곳으로 다니며 자기의 소유 아닌 거할 곳들을 점령하는 갈대아 사람을 일으켰나니","vi_vie":"Nầy, ta khiến người Canh-đê dấy lên, nó là một dân dữ tợn lung lăng, hay đi khắp đất được chiếm lấy những chỗ ở không thuộc về mình.","he_wlc":"כִּֽי ־ הִנְנִ֤י מֵקִים֙ אֶת ־ הַכַּשְׂדִּ֔ים הַגּ֖וֹי הַמַּ֣ר וְהַנִּמְהָ֑ר הַֽהוֹלֵךְ֙ לְמֶרְחֲבֵי ־ אֶ֔רֶץ לָרֶ֖שֶׁת מִשְׁכָּנ֥וֹת לֹּא ־ לֽוֹ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"我","s":["H2009"]},{"w":"必興起","s":["H6965","H853"],"m":["8688"]},{"w":"迦勒底人","s":["H3778"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"就是那殘忍","s":["H4751"]},{"w":"暴躁","s":["H4116"],"m":["8737"]},{"w":"之民","s":["H1471"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"通行","s":["H1980"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"遍","s":["H9001","H4800"]},{"w":"地","s":["H776"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"佔據","s":["H9001","H3423"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"那不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"屬自己","s":["H9001"]},{"w":"的住處","s":["H4908"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"For, lo, I raise up","s":["H6965"],"m":["8688"]},{"w":"the Chaldeans","s":["H3778"]},{"w":","},{"w":"that bitter","s":["H4751"]},{"w":"and hasty","s":["H4116"],"m":["8737"]},{"w":"nation","s":["H1471"]},{"w":","},{"w":"which shall march","s":["H1980"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"through the breadth","s":["H4800"]},{"w":"of the land","s":["H776"]},{"w":","},{"w":"to possess","s":["H3423"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"the dwellingplaces","s":["H4908"]},{"w":"that are not theirs.","i":1}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"כִּֽי","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"־ הִנְנִ֤י","s":["H2005"]},{"w":"מֵקִים֙","s":["H6965"]},{"w":"אֶת","s":["H853"]},{"w":"־ הַכַּשְׂדִּ֔ים","s":["H3778"]},{"w":"הַגּ֖וֹי","s":["H1471"]},{"w":"הַמַּ֣ר","s":["H4751"]},{"w":"וְהַנִּמְהָ֑ר","s":["H4116"]},{"w":"הַֽהוֹלֵךְ֙","s":["H1980"]},{"w":"לְמֶרְחֲבֵי","s":["H4800"]},{"w":"־ אֶ֔רֶץ","s":["H776"]},{"w":"לָרֶ֖שֶׁת","s":["H3423"]},{"w":"מִשְׁכָּנ֥וֹת","s":["H4908"]},{"w":"לֹּא","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"־ לֽוֹ ׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["breadth: Heb. breadths"]}},{"s":7,"t":{"zh_unv":"他威武可畏，判斷和勢力都任意發出。","en_kjv":"They are terrible and dreadful: their judgment and their dignity shall proceed of themselves.","en_web":"They are feared and dreaded. Their judgment and their dignity proceed from themselves.","es_rvr1909":"Espantosa es y terrible: de ella misma saldrá su derecho y su grandeza.","es_rvc":"Es un pueblo formidable y terrible, que por sí mismo decide lo que es justo y digno.","fr_nbs":"Il est terrible et redoutable, il impose lui-même son droit et sa suprématie.","ja_jp":"これはきびしく、恐ろしく、そのさばきと威厳とは彼ら自身から出る。","ko_kor":"그들은 두렵고 무서우며 심판과 위령이 자기로 말미암으며","vi_vie":"Nó thật là đáng sợ và đáng ghê, oai nghi và sự phán xét của nó đều là từ nó mà đến.","he_wlc":"אָיֹ֥ם וְנוֹרָ֖א ה֑וּא מִמֶּ֕נּוּ מִשְׁפָּט֥וֹ וּשְׂאֵת֖וֹ יֵצֵֽא ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"他","s":["H1931"]},{"w":"威武","s":["H366"]},{"w":"可畏","s":["H3372"],"m":["8737"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"判斷","s":["H4941"]},{"w":"和勢力","s":["H7613"]},{"w":"都任意","s":["H4480"]},{"w":"發出","s":["H3318"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"They are terrible","s":["H366"]},{"w":"and dreadful","s":["H3372"],"m":["8737"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"their judgment","s":["H4941"]},{"w":"and their dignity","s":["H7613"]},{"w":"shall proceed","s":["H3318"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"of themselves."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"אָיֹ֥ם","s":["H366"]},{"w":"וְנוֹרָ֖א","s":["H3372"]},{"w":"ה֑וּא","s":["H1931"]},{"w":"מִמֶּ֕נּוּ","s":["H4480"]},{"w":"מִשְׁפָּט֥וֹ","s":["H4941"]},{"w":"וּשְׂאֵת֖וֹ","s":["H7613"]},{"w":"יֵצֵֽא","s":["H3318"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["their judgment...: or, from them shall proceed the judgment of these, and the captivity of these"]}},{"s":8,"t":{"zh_unv":"他的馬比豹更快，比晚上的豺狼更猛。馬兵踴躍爭先，都從遠方而來；他們飛跑如鷹抓食，","en_kjv":"Their horses also are swifter than the leopards, and are more fierce than the evening wolves: and their horsemen shall spread themselves, and their horsemen shall come from far; they shall fly as the eagle that hasteth to eat.","en_web":"Their horses also are swifter than leopards, and are more fierce than the evening wolves. Their horsemen press proudly on. Yes, their horsemen come from afar. They fly as an eagle that hurries to devour.","es_rvr1909":"Y serán sus caballos más ligeros que tigres, y más agudos que lobos de tarde; y sus jinetes se multiplicarán: vendrán de lejos sus caballeros, y volarán como águilas que se apresuran á la comida.","es_rvc":"Sus caballos son más ligeros que los leopardos y más feroces que los lobos nocturnos. Sus jinetes vienen de lejos, a galope tendido; vienen raudos como águilas, dispuestos a devorar,","fr_nbs":"Ses chevaux sont plus rapides que des léopards, plus mordants que les loups du soir. Ses chars se déploient, ses chars viennent de loin, ils volent comme l’aigle qui fond sur sa proie.","ja_jp":"その馬はひょうよりも速く、夜のおおかみよりも荒い。その騎兵は威勢よく進む。すなわち、その騎兵は遠い所から来る。彼らは物を食おうと急ぐわしのように飛ぶ。","ko_kor":"그 말은 표범보다 빠르고 저녁 이리보다 사나우며 그 기병은 원방에서부터 빨리 달려오는 기병이라 마치 식물을 움키려하는 독수리의 날음과 같으니라","vi_vie":"Những ngựa nó nhặm lẹ hơn con beo, và hung hơn muông sói ban đêm. Những lính kỵ nó tràn khắp đây đó, những lính kỵ nó đến từ phương xa; chúng nó bay như chim ưng lẹ, nôn nả kiếm ăn.","he_wlc":"וְקַלּ֨וּ מִנְּמֵרִ֜ים סוּסָ֗יו וְחַדּוּ֙ מִזְּאֵ֣בֵי עֶ֔רֶב וּפָ֖שׁוּ פָּֽרָשָׁ֑יו וּפָֽרָשָׁיו֙ מֵרָח֣וֹק יָבֹ֔אוּ יָעֻ֕פוּ כְּנֶ֖שֶׁר חָ֥שׁ לֶאֱכֽוֹל ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"他的馬","s":["H5483"]},{"w":"比豹","s":["H4480","H5246"]},{"w":"更快","s":["H7043"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"比晚上","s":["H6153"]},{"w":"的豺狼","s":["H4480","H2061"]},{"w":"更猛","s":["H2300"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"。"},{"w":"馬兵","s":["H6571","H6571"]},{"w":"踴躍爭先","s":["H6335"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"都從遠方","s":["H4480","H7350"]},{"w":"而來","s":["H935"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"他們飛跑","s":["H5774"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"如鷹","s":["H9003","H5404"]},{"w":"抓","s":["H2363"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"食","s":["H9001","H398"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"，"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Their horses","s":["H5483"]},{"w":"also are swifter","s":["H7043"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"than the leopards","s":["H5246"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and are more fierce","s":["H2300"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"than the evening","s":["H6153"]},{"w":"wolves","s":["H2061"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"and their horsemen","s":["H6571"]},{"w":"shall spread","s":["H6335"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"themselves, and their horsemen","s":["H6571"]},{"w":"shall come","s":["H935"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"from far","s":["H7350"]},{"w":";"},{"w":"they shall fly","s":["H5774"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"as the eagle","s":["H5404"]},{"w":"that hasteth","s":["H2363"],"m":["8804"],"i":1},{"w":"to eat","s":["H398"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"וְקַלּ֨וּ","s":["H7043"]},{"w":"מִנְּמֵרִ֜ים","s":["H5246"]},{"w":"סוּסָ֗יו","s":["H5483"]},{"w":"וְחַדּוּ֙","s":["H2300"]},{"w":"מִזְּאֵ֣בֵי","s":["H2061"]},{"w":"עֶ֔רֶב","s":["H6153"]},{"w":"וּפָ֖שׁוּ","s":["H6335"]},{"w":"פָּֽרָשָׁ֑יו","s":["H6571"]},{"w":"וּפָֽרָשָׁיו֙","s":["H6571"]},{"w":"מֵרָח֣וֹק","s":["H7350"]},{"w":"יָבֹ֔אוּ","s":["H935"]},{"w":"יָעֻ֕פוּ","s":["H5774"]},{"w":"כְּנֶ֖שֶׁר","s":["H5404"]},{"w":"חָ֥שׁ","s":["H2363"]},{"w":"לֶאֱכֽוֹל","s":["H398"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["fierce: Heb. sharp"]}},{"s":9,"t":{"zh_unv":"都為行強暴而來，定住臉面向前，將擄掠的人聚集，多如塵沙。","en_kjv":"They shall come all for violence: their faces shall sup up as the east wind, and they shall gather the captivity as the sand.","en_web":"All of them come for violence. Their hordes face the desert. He gathers prisoners like sand.","es_rvr1909":"Toda ella vendrá á la presa: delante de sus caras viento solano; y juntará cautivos como arena.","es_rvc":"¡y todos ellos caen sobre su presa! El terror los precede, y recogen cautivos como quien recoge arena.","fr_nbs":"Tout entier, il arrive pour la violence ; le visage tendu vers l’avant, il amasse des captifs comme du sable.","ja_jp":"彼らはみな暴虐のために来る。彼らを恐れる恐れが彼らの前を行く。彼らはとりこを砂のように集める。","ko_kor":"그들은 다 강포를 행하러 오는데 앞을 향하여 나아가며 사람을 사로잡아 모으기를 모래 같이 많이 할 것이요","vi_vie":"Cả dân ấy đến đặng làm sự bạo ngược; chúng nó mạnh dạn đi thẳng tối, và dồn phu tù lại như cát.","he_wlc":"כֻּלֹּה֙ לְחָמָ֣ס יָב֔וֹא מְגַמַּ֥ת פְּנֵיהֶ֖ם קָדִ֑ימָה וַיֶּאֱסֹ֥ף כַּח֖וֹל שֶֽׁבִי ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"都","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"為行強暴","s":["H9001","H2555"]},{"w":"而來","s":["H935"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"定住","s":["H4041"]},{"w":"臉面","s":["H6440"]},{"w":"向前","s":["H6921"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"將擄掠的人","s":["H7628"]},{"w":"聚集","s":["H622"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"多如塵沙","s":["H9003","H2344"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"They shall come","s":["H935"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"all for violence","s":["H2555"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"their faces","s":["H6440"]},{"w":"shall sup up","s":["H4041"]},{"w":"as the east wind","s":["H6921"],"i":1},{"w":","},{"w":"and they shall gather","s":["H622"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"the captivity","s":["H7628"]},{"w":"as the sand","s":["H2344"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"כֻּלֹּה֙","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"לְחָמָ֣ס","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"יָב֔וֹא","s":["H935"]},{"w":"מְגַמַּ֥ת","s":["H4041"]},{"w":"פְּנֵיהֶ֖ם","s":["H6440"]},{"w":"קָדִ֑ימָה","s":["H6921"]},{"w":"וַיֶּאֱסֹ֥ף","s":["H622"]},{"w":"כַּח֖וֹל","s":["H2344"]},{"w":"שֶֽׁבִי","s":["H7628"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["their...: or, the supping up of their faces, etc: or, their faces shall look (Heb. the opposition of their faces) toward the east"]}},{"s":10,"t":{"zh_unv":"他們譏誚君王，笑話首領，嗤笑一切保障，築壘攻取。","en_kjv":"And they shall scoff at the kings, and the princes shall be a scorn unto them: they shall deride every strong hold; for they shall heap dust, and take it.","en_web":"Yes, he scoffs at kings, and princes are a derision to him. He laughs at every stronghold, for he builds up an earthen ramp, and takes it.","es_rvr1909":"Y escarnecerá de los reyes, y de los príncipes hará burla: reiráse de toda fortaleza, y amontonará polvo, y la tomará.","es_rvc":"Se ríen de los reyes, se burlan de los príncipes; hacen mofa de toda fortaleza: construyen terraplenes y conquistan ciudades.","fr_nbs":"Lui, il se moque des rois, il rit des princes. Il se rit de toute forteresse : il amoncelle de la terre, et il la prend.","ja_jp":"彼らは王たちを侮り、つかさたちをあざける。彼らはすべての城をあざ笑い、土を積み上げてこれを奪う。","ko_kor":"열왕을 멸시하며 방백을 치소하며 모든 견고한 성을 비웃고 흉벽을 쌓아 그것을 취할 것이라","vi_vie":"Nó nhạo cười các vua, chế báng các quan trưởng, và chê cười mỗi đồn lũy: nó đắp lũy, rồi chiếm lấy.","he_wlc":"וְהוּא֙ בַּמְּלָכִ֣ים יִתְקַלָּ֔ס וְרֹזְנִ֖ים מִשְׂחָ֣ק ל֑וֹ ה֚וּא לְכָל ־ מִבְצָ֣ר יִשְׂחָ֔ק וַיִּצְבֹּ֥ר עָפָ֖ר וַֽיִּלְכְּדָֽהּ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"他們","s":["H1931"]},{"w":"譏誚","s":["H7046"],"m":["8691"]},{"w":"君王","s":["H9002","H4428"]},{"w":"，","s":["H9001"]},{"w":"笑話","s":["H4890"]},{"w":"首領","s":["H7336"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"，","s":["H1931"]},{"w":"嗤笑","s":["H7832"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"一切","s":["H9001","H3605"]},{"w":"保障","s":["H4013"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"築","s":["H6651"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"壘","s":["H6083"]},{"w":"攻取","s":["H3920"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"And they shall scoff","s":["H7046"],"m":["8691"]},{"w":"at the kings","s":["H4428"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and the princes","s":["H7336"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"shall be a scorn","s":["H4890"]},{"w":"unto them: they shall deride","s":["H7832"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"every strong hold","s":["H4013"]},{"w":";"},{"w":"for they shall heap","s":["H6651"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"dust","s":["H6083"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and take","s":["H3920"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"it."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"וְהוּא֙","s":["H1931"]},{"w":"בַּמְּלָכִ֣ים","s":["H4428"]},{"w":"יִתְקַלָּ֔ס","s":["H7046"]},{"w":"וְרֹזְנִ֖ים","s":["H7336"]},{"w":"מִשְׂחָ֣ק","s":["H4890"]},{"w":"ל֑וֹ ה֚וּא","s":["H1931"]},{"w":"לְכָל","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"־ מִבְצָ֣ר","s":["H4013"]},{"w":"יִשְׂחָ֔ק","s":["H7832"]},{"w":"וַיִּצְבֹּ֥ר","s":["H6651"]},{"w":"עָפָ֖ר","s":["H6083"]},{"w":"וַֽיִּלְכְּדָֽהּ","s":["H3920"]},{"w":"׃"}]}},{"s":11,"t":{"zh_unv":"他以自己的勢力為神，像風猛然掃過，顯為有罪。","en_kjv":"Then shall his mind change, and he shall pass over, and offend, imputing this his power unto his god.","en_web":"Then he sweeps by like the wind, and goes on. He is indeed guilty, whose strength is his god.\"","es_rvr1909":"Luego mudará espíritu, y pasará adelante, y ofenderá atribuyendo esta su potencia á su dios.","es_rvc":"Pasan con la fuerza de una tormenta, y esa fuerza la atribuyen a su dios.»","fr_nbs":"Alors un souffle passe et s’en va ; il se met en tort, lui dont la force est pour son dieu !","ja_jp":"こうして、彼らは風のようになぎ倒して行き過ぎる。彼らは罪深い者で、おのれの力を神となす。","ko_kor":"그들은 그 힘으로 자기 신을 삼는 자라 이에 바람 같이 급히 몰아 지나치게 행하여 득죄하리라","vi_vie":"Bấy giờ nó sẽ sấn tới như gió thổi qua; vì nó lấy sức mạnh mình là thần mình, nên phạm tội trọng.","he_wlc":"אָ֣ז חָלַ֥ף ר֛וּחַ וַֽיַּעֲבֹ֖ר וְאָשֵׁ֑ם ז֥וּ כֹח֖וֹ לֵאלֹהֽוֹ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"他以","s":["H2098"]},{"w":"自己的勢力","s":["H3581"]},{"w":"為神","s":["H9001","H433"]},{"w":"，","s":["H227"]},{"w":"像風","s":["H7307"]},{"w":"猛然掃","s":["H2498"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"過","s":["H5674"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"顯為有罪","s":["H816"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Then shall his mind","s":["H7307"]},{"w":"change","s":["H2498"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and he shall pass over","s":["H5674"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and offend","s":["H816"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":","},{"w":"imputing this","s":["H2098"]},{"w":"his power","s":["H3581"]},{"w":"unto his god","s":["H433"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"אָ֣ז","s":["H227"]},{"w":"חָלַ֥ף","s":["H2498"]},{"w":"ר֛וּחַ","s":["H7307"]},{"w":"וַֽיַּעֲבֹ֖ר","s":["H5674"]},{"w":"וְאָשֵׁ֑ם","s":["H816"]},{"w":"ז֥וּ","s":["H2098"]},{"w":"כֹח֖וֹ","s":["H3581"]},{"w":"לֵאלֹהֽוֹ","s":["H430"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"p":1},{"s":12,"t":{"zh_unv":"耶和華─我的　神，我的聖者啊，你不是從亙古而有嗎？我們必不致死。耶和華啊，你派定他為要刑罰人；磐石啊，你設立他為要懲治人。","en_kjv":"Art thou not from everlasting, O LORD my God, mine Holy One? we shall not die. O LORD, thou hast ordained them for judgment; and, O mighty God, thou hast established them for correction.","en_web":"Aren't you from everlasting, Yahweh my God, my Holy One? We will not die. Yahweh, you have appointed him for judgment. You, Rock, have established him to punish.","es_rvr1909":"¿No eres tú desde el principio, oh Jehová, Dios mío, Santo mío? No moriremos. Oh Jehová, para juicio lo pusiste; y tú, oh Roca, lo fundaste para castigar.","es_rvc":"Tú, Señor, eres un Dios santo. Tú existes desde el principio; ¡no nos dejes morir! Tú, Señor, eres nuestra Roca; ¡no hagas que este pueblo nos juzgue y nos castigue!","fr_nbs":"— Mais toi, n’es-tu pas dès le temps jadis, SEIGNEUR, mon Dieu, mon Saint ? Tu ne meurs pas ! SEIGNEUR, tu l’as établi pour le jugement ; mon Rocher, tu l’as institué pour châtier.","ja_jp":"わが神、主、わが聖者よ。あなたは永遠からいますかたではありませんか。わたしたちは死んではならない。主よ、あなたは彼らをさばきのために備えられた。岩よ、あなたは彼らを懲しめのために立てられた。","ko_kor":"선지자가 가로되 여호와 나의 하나님 나의 거룩한 자시여 주께서는 만세 전부터 계시지 아니하시니이까 ? 우리가 사망에 이르지 아니하리이다 여호와여 ! 주께서 심판하기 위하여 그를 두셨나이다 반석이시여 ! 주께서 경계하기 위하여 그를 세우셨나이다","vi_vie":"Hỡi Giê-hô-va, Đức Chúa Trời tôi, Đấng Thánh của tôi! Ngài há chẳng phải là từ đời đời vô cùng sao? Vậy chúng tôi sẽ không chết! Hỡi Đức Giê-hô-va, Ngài đã lập dân nầy đặng làm sự xét đoán của Ngài. Hỡi vầng Đá! Ngài đã đặt nó đặng làm sự sửa phạt!","he_wlc":"הֲל֧וֹא אַתָּ֣ה מִקֶּ֗דֶם יְהוָ֧ה אֱלֹהַ֛י קְדֹשִׁ֖י לֹ֣א נָמ֑וּת יְהוָה֙ לְמִשְׁפָּ֣ט שַׂמְתּ֔וֹ וְצ֖וּר לְהוֹכִ֥יחַ יְסַדְתּֽוֹ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"耶和華","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"─我的　神","s":["H430"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"我的聖者","s":["H6918"]},{"w":"啊，你","s":["H859"]},{"w":"不是","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"從亙古","s":["H4480","H6924"]},{"w":"而有嗎？我們必不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"致死","s":["H4191"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"。"},{"w":"耶和華","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"啊，你派定他","s":["H7760"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"為要刑罰","s":["H9001","H4941"]},{"w":"人；磐石","s":["H6697"]},{"w":"啊，你設立他","s":["H3245"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"為要懲治","s":["H9001","H3198"],"m":["8687"]},{"w":"人。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Art thou not from everlasting","s":["H6924"],"i":1},{"w":","},{"w":"O LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"my God","s":["H430"]},{"w":","},{"w":"mine Holy One","s":["H6918"]},{"w":"?"},{"w":"we shall not die","s":["H4191"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"."},{"w":"O LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"w":","},{"w":"thou hast ordained","s":["H7760"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"them for judgment","s":["H4941"]},{"w":";"},{"w":"and, O mighty God","s":["H6697"]},{"w":","},{"w":"thou hast established","s":["H3245"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"them for correction","s":["H3198"],"m":["8687"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"הֲל֧וֹא","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"אַתָּ֣ה","s":["H859"]},{"w":"מִקֶּ֗דֶם","s":["H6924"]},{"w":"יְהוָ֧ה","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"אֱלֹהַ֛י","s":["H430"]},{"w":"קְדֹשִׁ֖י","s":["H6918"]},{"w":"לֹ֣א","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"נָמ֑וּת","s":["H4191"]},{"w":"יְהוָה֙","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"לְמִשְׁפָּ֣ט","s":["H4941"]},{"w":"שַׂמְתּ֔וֹ","s":["H7760"]},{"w":"וְצ֖וּר","s":["H6697"]},{"w":"לְהוֹכִ֥יחַ","s":["H3198"]},{"w":"יְסַדְתּֽוֹ","s":["H3245"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["mighty...: Heb. rock","established: Heb. founded"]}},{"s":13,"t":{"zh_unv":"你眼目清潔，不看邪僻，不看奸惡；行詭詐的，你為何看著不理呢？惡人吞滅比自己公義的，你為何靜默不語呢？","en_kjv":"Thou art of purer eyes than to behold evil, and canst not look on iniquity: wherefore lookest thou upon them that deal treacherously, and holdest thy tongue when the wicked devoureth the man that is more righteous than he?","en_web":"You who have purer eyes than to see evil, and who cannot look on perversity, why do you tolerate those who deal treacherously, and keep silent when the wicked swallows up the man who is more righteous than he,","es_rvr1909":"Muy limpio eres de ojos para ver el mal, ni puedes ver el agravio: ¿por qué ves los menospreciadores, y callas cuando destruye el impío al más justo que él,","es_rvc":"Si por la pureza de tus ojos no soportas ver el mal ni los agravios, ¿por qué soportas ver a quienes nos desprecian? ¿Por qué callas cuando los impíos destruyen a quienes son más justos que ellos?","fr_nbs":"Tes yeux sont trop purs pour voir ce qui est mauvais, tu ne peux pas regarder l’oppression. Pourquoi donc regardes-tu les traîtres ? Pourquoi gardes-tu le silence quand un méchant engloutit plus juste que lui ?","ja_jp":"あなたは目が清く、悪を見られない者、また不義を見られない者であるのに、何ゆえ不真実な者に目をとめていられるのですか。悪しき者が自分よりも正しい者を、のみ食らうのに、何ゆえ黙っていられるのですか。","ko_kor":"주께서는 눈이 정결하시므로 악을 참아 보지 못하시며 패역을 참아 보지 못하시거늘 어찌하여 궤휼한 자들을 방관하시며 악인이 자기보다 의로운 사람을 삼키되 잠잠하시나이까 ?","vi_vie":"Mắt Chúa thánh sạch chẳng nhìn sự dữ, chẳng có thể nhìn được sự trái ngược. Sao Ngài nhìn xem kẻ làm sự dối trá, khi kẻ dữ nuốt người công bình hơn nó, sao Ngài nín lặng đi?","he_wlc":"טְה֤וֹר עֵינַ֨יִם֙ מֵרְא֣וֹת רָ֔ע וְהַבִּ֥יט אֶל ־ עָמָ֖ל לֹ֣א תוּכָ֑ל לָ֤מָּה תַבִּיט֙ בּֽוֹגְדִ֔ים תַּחֲרִ֕ישׁ בְּבַלַּ֥ע רָשָׁ֖ע צַדִּ֥יק מִמֶּֽנּוּ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"你眼目","s":["H5869"]},{"w":"清潔","s":["H2889"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"不看","s":["H4480","H7200"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"邪僻","s":["H7451"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"不","s":["H3808","H3201"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"看","s":["H5027","H413"],"m":["8687"]},{"w":"奸惡","s":["H5999"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"行詭詐的","s":["H898"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"你為何","s":["H9001","H4100"]},{"w":"看著","s":["H5027"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"不理呢？惡人","s":["H7563"]},{"w":"吞滅","s":["H9002","H1104"],"m":["8763"]},{"w":"比自己","s":["H4480"]},{"w":"公義","s":["H6662"]},{"w":"的，你為何靜默不語","s":["H2790"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"呢？"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Thou art of purer","s":["H2889"],"i":1},{"w":"eyes","s":["H5869"]},{"w":"than to behold","s":["H7200"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"evil","s":["H7451"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and canst","s":["H3201"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"not look","s":["H5027"],"m":["8687"]},{"w":"on iniquity","s":["H5999"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"wherefore lookest","s":["H5027"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"thou upon them that deal treacherously","s":["H898"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and holdest thy tongue","s":["H2790"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"when the wicked","s":["H7563"]},{"w":"devoureth","s":["H1104"],"m":["8763"]},{"w":"the man that is more righteous","s":["H6662"],"i":1},{"w":"than he?"}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"טְה֤וֹר","s":["H2890"]},{"w":"עֵינַ֨יִם֙","s":["H5869"]},{"w":"מֵרְא֣וֹת","s":["H7200"]},{"w":"רָ֔ע","s":["H7451"]},{"w":"וְהַבִּ֥יט","s":["H5027"]},{"w":"אֶל","s":["H413"]},{"w":"־ עָמָ֖ל","s":["H5999"]},{"w":"לֹ֣א","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"תוּכָ֑ל","s":["H3201"]},{"w":"לָ֤מָּה","s":["H4100"]},{"w":"תַבִּיט֙","s":["H5027"]},{"w":"בּֽוֹגְדִ֔ים","s":["H898"]},{"w":"תַּחֲרִ֕ישׁ","s":["H2790"]},{"w":"בְּבַלַּ֥ע","s":["H1104"]},{"w":"רָשָׁ֖ע","s":["H7563"]},{"w":"צַדִּ֥יק","s":["H6662"]},{"w":"מִמֶּֽנּוּ","s":["H4480"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["iniquity: or, grievance"]}},{"s":14,"t":{"zh_unv":"你為何使人如海中的魚，又如沒有管轄的爬物呢？","en_kjv":"And makest men as the fishes of the sea, as the creeping things, that have no ruler over them?","en_web":"and make men like the fish of the sea, like the creeping things, that have no ruler over them?","es_rvr1909":"Y haces que sean los hombres como los peces de la mar, como reptiles que no tienen señor?","es_rvc":"¡Tratas a la gente como a los peces del mar, como a los insectos, que no tienen quien los gobierne!","fr_nbs":"Tu traites les humains comme les poissons de la mer, comme les bestioles qui n’ont pas de maître.","ja_jp":"あなたは人を海の魚のようにし、治める者のない這う虫のようにされる。","ko_kor":"주께서 어찌하여 사람으로 바다의 어족 같게 하시며 주권자 없는 곤충 같게 하시나이까 ?","vi_vie":"Sao Ngài khiến loài người như cá biển và như loài côn trùng vô chủ?","he_wlc":"וַתַּעֲשֶׂ֥ה אָדָ֖ם כִּדְגֵ֣י הַיָּ֑ם כְּרֶ֖מֶשׂ לֹא ־ מֹשֵׁ֥ל בּֽוֹ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"你為何使","s":["H6213"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"人","s":["H120"]},{"w":"如海中","s":["H3220"]},{"w":"的魚","s":["H9003","H1709"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"又如沒有","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"管轄","s":["H4910","H9002"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"的爬物","s":["H9003","H7431"]},{"w":"呢？"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"And makest","s":["H6213"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"men","s":["H120"]},{"w":"as the fishes","s":["H1709"]},{"w":"of the sea","s":["H3220"]},{"w":","},{"w":"as the creeping things","s":["H7431"]},{"w":","},{"w":"that have no ruler","s":["H4910"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"over them?"}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"וַתַּעֲשֶׂ֥ה","s":["H6213"]},{"w":"אָדָ֖ם","s":["H120"]},{"w":"כִּדְגֵ֣י","s":["H1709"]},{"w":"הַיָּ֑ם","s":["H3220"]},{"w":"כְּרֶ֖מֶשׂ","s":["H7431"]},{"w":"לֹא","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"־ מֹשֵׁ֥ל","s":["H4910"]},{"w":"בּֽוֹ ׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["creeping: or, moving"]}},{"s":15,"t":{"zh_unv":"他用鉤鉤住，用網捕獲，用拉網聚集他們；因此，他歡喜快樂，","en_kjv":"They take up all of them with the angle, they catch them in their net, and gather them in their drag: therefore they rejoice and are glad.","en_web":"He takes up all of them with the hook. He catches them in his net, and gathers them in his dragnet. Therefore he rejoices and is glad.","es_rvr1909":"Sacará á todos con anzuelo, cogerálos con su red, y juntarálos en su aljerife: por lo cual se holgará y hará alegrías.","es_rvc":"Los caldeos nos pescan a todos con anzuelos y nos recogen con sus redes. ¡Con gran alegría y regocijo nos amontonan en sus mallas!","fr_nbs":"Tous, il les enlève à l’hameçon, il les tire dans son filet, il les recueille dans sa nasse. Alors il se réjouit, il est dans l’allégresse.","ja_jp":"彼はつり針でこれをことごとくつり上げ、網でこれを捕え、引き網でこれを集め、こうして彼は喜び楽しむ。","ko_kor":"그가 낚시로 모두 취하며 그물로 잡으며 초망으로 모으고 인하여 기뻐하고 즐거워하여","vi_vie":"Nó đã dùng lưỡi câu móc lấy cả, thâu góp trong chài mình, và nhóm lại trong lưới mình, vậy nên nó vui mừng và lấy làm thích.","he_wlc":"כֻּלֹּה֙ בְּחַכָּ֣ה הֵֽעֲלָ֔ה יְגֹרֵ֣הוּ בְחֶרְמ֔וֹ וְיַאַסְפֵ֖הוּ בְּמִכְמַרְתּ֑וֹ עַל ־ כֵּ֖ן יִשְׂמַ֥ח וְיָגִֽיל ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"他用鉤","s":["H9002","H2443"]},{"w":"鉤住","s":["H5927","H3605"],"m":["8689"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"用網","s":["H9002","H2764"]},{"w":"捕獲","s":["H1641"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"用拉網","s":["H9002","H4365"]},{"w":"聚集他們","s":["H622"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"因","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"此","s":["H3651"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"他歡喜","s":["H8055"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"快樂","s":["H1523"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"They take up","s":["H5927"],"m":["8689"]},{"w":"all of them with the angle","s":["H2443"]},{"w":","},{"w":"they catch","s":["H1641"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"them in their net","s":["H2764"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and gather","s":["H622"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"them in their drag","s":["H4365"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"therefore they rejoice","s":["H8055"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"and are glad","s":["H1523"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"כֻּלֹּה֙","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"בְּחַכָּ֣ה","s":["H2443"]},{"w":"הֵֽעֲלָ֔ה","s":["H5927"]},{"w":"יְגֹרֵ֣הוּ","s":["H1641"]},{"w":"בְחֶרְמ֔וֹ","s":["H2764"]},{"w":"וְיַאַסְפֵ֖הוּ","s":["H622"]},{"w":"בְּמִכְמַרְתּ֑וֹ","s":["H4365"]},{"w":"עַל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"־ כֵּ֖ן","s":["H3651"]},{"w":"יִשְׂמַ֥ח","s":["H8055"]},{"w":"וְיָגִֽיל","s":["H1523"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["drag: or, flue net"]}},{"s":16,"t":{"zh_unv":"就向網獻祭，向網燒香，因他由此得肥美的分和富裕的食物。","en_kjv":"Therefore they sacrifice unto their net, and burn incense unto their drag; because by them their portion is fat, and their meat plenteous.","en_web":"Therefore he sacrifices to his net, and burns incense to his dragnet, because by them his life is luxurious, and his food is good.","es_rvr1909":"Por esto hará sacrificios á su red, y ofrecerá sahumerios á su aljerife: porque con ellos engordó su porción, y engrasó su comida.","es_rvc":"Luego ofrecen sacrificios a sus redes, y queman incienso a sus mallas, pues gracias a ellas aumentan sus riquezas y su fuente de alimentos.","fr_nbs":"Alors, il offre un sacrifice à son filet, de l’encens à sa nasse, car par eux sa part est grasse, sa nourriture copieuse.","ja_jp":"それゆえ、彼はその網に犠牲をささげ、その引き網に香をたく。これによって彼はぜいたくに暮し、その食物も豊かになるからである。","ko_kor":"그물에 제사하며 초망 앞에 분향하오니 이는 그것을 힘입어 소득이 풍부하고 식물이 풍성케 됨이니이다","vi_vie":"Vì cớ đó, nó dâng tế cho lưới, đốt hương cho chài, bởi chưng nó nhờ đó mà được phần béo tốt và của ăn dư dật.","he_wlc":"עַל ־ כֵּן֙ יְזַבֵּ֣חַ לְחֶרְמ֔וֹ וִֽיקַטֵּ֖ר לְמִכְמַרְתּ֑וֹ כִּ֤י בָהֵ֨מָּה֙ שָׁמֵ֣ן חֶלְק֔וֹ וּמַאֲכָל֖וֹ בְּרִאָֽה ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"就","s":["H5921","H3651"]},{"w":"向網","s":["H9001","H2764"]},{"w":"獻祭","s":["H2076"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"向網","s":["H9001","H4365"]},{"w":"燒香","s":["H6999"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"因","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"他由此","s":["H9002","H1992"]},{"w":"得肥美","s":["H8082"]},{"w":"的分","s":["H2506"]},{"w":"和富裕","s":["H1277"]},{"w":"的食物","s":["H3978"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Therefore they sacrifice","s":["H2076"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"unto their net","s":["H2764"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and burn incense","s":["H6999"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"unto their drag","s":["H4365"]},{"w":";"},{"w":"because by them","s":["H1992"]},{"w":"their portion","s":["H2506"]},{"w":"is fat","s":["H8082"],"i":1},{"w":","},{"w":"and their meat","s":["H3978"]},{"w":"plenteous","s":["H1277"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"עַל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"־ כֵּן֙","s":["H3651"]},{"w":"יְזַבֵּ֣חַ","s":["H2076"]},{"w":"לְחֶרְמ֔וֹ","s":["H2764"]},{"w":"וִֽיקַטֵּ֖ר","s":["H6999"]},{"w":"לְמִכְמַרְתּ֑וֹ","s":["H4365"]},{"w":"כִּ֤י","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"בָהֵ֨מָּה֙","s":["H1992"]},{"w":"שָׁמֵ֣ן","s":["H8082"]},{"w":"חֶלְק֔וֹ","s":["H2506"]},{"w":"וּמַאֲכָל֖וֹ","s":["H3978"]},{"w":"בְּרִאָֽה","s":["H1277"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["plenteous: or, dainty: Heb. fat"]}},{"s":17,"t":{"zh_unv":"他豈可屢次倒空網羅，將列國的人時常殺戮，毫不顧惜呢？","en_kjv":"Shall they therefore empty their net, and not spare continually to slay the nations?","en_web":"Will he therefore continually empty his net, and kill the nations without mercy?","es_rvr1909":"¿Vaciará por eso su red, ó tendrá piedad de matar gentes continuamente?","es_rvc":"¡Pero ni así dejan de lanzar sus redes, ni se apiadan de las naciones, a las que siguen destruyendo sin cesar!","fr_nbs":"Alors, va-t-il vider son filet, et massacrer des nations constamment, sans épargner personne ?","ja_jp":"それで、彼はいつまでもその網の獲物を取り入れて、無情にも諸国民を殺すのであろうか。","ko_kor":"그가 그물을 떨고는 연하여 늘 열국을 살륙함이 옳으니이까 ?","vi_vie":"Có lẽ nào nó cứ đổ lưới mình ra đặng làm sự giết lát các dân không hề thôi sao?","he_wlc":"הַ֥עַל כֵּ֖ן יָרִ֣יק חֶרְמ֑וֹ וְתָמִ֛יד לַהֲרֹ֥ג גּוֹיִ֖ם לֹ֥א יַחְמֽוֹל ׃ ס"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"他豈可","s":["H5921","H3651"]},{"w":"屢次倒空","s":["H7324"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"網羅","s":["H2764"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"將列國","s":["H1471"]},{"w":"的人時常","s":["H8548"]},{"w":"殺戮","s":["H9001","H2026"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"毫不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"顧惜","s":["H2550"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"呢？"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Shall they therefore empty","s":["H7324"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"their net","s":["H2764"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and not spare","s":["H2550"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"continually","s":["H8548"]},{"w":"to slay","s":["H2026"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"the nations","s":["H1471"]},{"w":"?"}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"הַ֥עַל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"כֵּ֖ן","s":["H3651"]},{"w":"יָרִ֣יק","s":["H7324"]},{"w":"חֶרְמ֑וֹ","s":["H2764"]},{"w":"וְתָמִ֛יד","s":["H8548"]},{"w":"לַהֲרֹ֥ג","s":["H2026"]},{"w":"גּוֹיִ֖ם","s":["H1471"]},{"w":"לֹ֥א","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"יַחְמֽוֹל","s":["H2550"]},{"w":"׃ ס"}]},"p":1}]},{"c":2,"v":[{"s":1,"t":{"zh_unv":"我要站在守望所，立在望樓上觀看，看耶和華對我說甚麼話，我可用甚麼話向他訴冤（向他訴冤：或譯回答所疑問的）。","en_kjv":"I will stand upon my watch, and set me upon the tower, and will watch to see what he will say unto me, and what I shall answer when I am reproved.","en_web":"I will stand at my watch, and set myself on the ramparts, and will look out to see what he will say to me, and what I will answer concerning my complaint.","es_rvr1909":"SOBRE mi guarda estaré, y sobre la fortaleza afirmaré el pie, y atalayaré para ver qué hablará en mí, y qué tengo de responder á mi pregunta.","es_rvc":"Decidí mantenerme vigilante. Decidí mantenerme en pie sobre la fortaleza. Decidí no dormir hasta saber lo que el Señor me iba a decir, y qué respuesta daría a mi queja.","fr_nbs":"Je vais me placer à mon poste de garde, je vais me tenir sur le rempart ; je vais guetter pour voir ce qu’il me dira, et ce que je répondrai au sujet de mes doléances.","ja_jp":"わたしはわたしの見張所に立ち、物見やぐらに身を置き、望み見て、彼がわたしになんと語られるかを見、またわたしの訴えについてわたし自らなんと答えたらよかろうかを見よう。","ko_kor":"내가 내 파수하는 곳에 서며 성루에 서리라 그가 내게 무엇이라 말씀하실는지 기다리고 바라보며 나의 질문에 대하여 어떻게 대답하실는지 보리라 그리하였더니","vi_vie":"Ta sẽ đứng nơi vọng canh, chôn chơn nơi đồn lũy, rình xem Ngài bảo ta điều gì, và ta trả lời thế nào về sự đối nại của ta.","he_wlc":"עַל ־ מִשְׁמַרְתִּ֣י אֶעֱמֹ֔דָה וְאֶֽתְיַצְּבָ֖ה עַל ־ מָצ֑וֹר וַאֲצַפֶּ֗ה לִרְאוֹת֙ מַה ־ יְדַבֶּר ־ בִּ֔י וּמָ֥ה אָשִׁ֖יב עַל ־ תּוֹכַחְתִּֽי ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"我要站","s":["H5975"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"在","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"守望所","s":["H4931"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"立","s":["H3320"],"m":["8691"]},{"w":"在","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"望樓上","s":["H4692"]},{"w":"觀看","s":["H6822"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"看","s":["H9001","H7200"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"耶和華對我","s":["H9002"]},{"w":"說","s":["H1696"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"甚麼","s":["H4100"]},{"w":"話，我可用甚麼","s":["H4100"]},{"w":"話向他訴冤（向他訴冤：或譯回答","s":["H7725","H5921"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"所疑問","s":["H8433"]},{"w":"的）。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"I will stand","s":["H5975"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"upon my watch","s":["H4931"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and set","s":["H3320"],"m":["8691"]},{"w":"me upon the tower","s":["H4692"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and will watch","s":["H6822"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"to see","s":["H7200"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"what he will say","s":["H1696"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"unto me, and what I shall answer","s":["H7725"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"when I am reproved","s":["H8433"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"עַל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"־ מִשְׁמַרְתִּ֣י","s":["H4931"]},{"w":"אֶעֱמֹ֔דָה","s":["H5975"]},{"w":"וְאֶֽתְיַצְּבָ֖ה","s":["H3320"]},{"w":"עַל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"־ מָצ֑וֹר","s":["H4692"]},{"w":"וַאֲצַפֶּ֗ה","s":["H6822"]},{"w":"לִרְאוֹת֙","s":["H7200"]},{"w":"מַה","s":["H4100"]},{"w":"־ יְדַבֶּר","s":["H1696"]},{"w":"־ בִּ֔י וּמָ֥ה","s":["H4100"]},{"w":"אָשִׁ֖יב","s":["H7725"]},{"w":"עַל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"־ תּוֹכַחְתִּֽי","s":["H8433"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["tower: Heb. fenced place","unto me: or, in me","when...: or, when I am argued with: Heb. upon my reproof, or, arguing"]}},{"s":2,"t":{"zh_unv":"他對我說：將這默示明明地寫在版上，使讀的人容易讀（或譯：隨跑隨讀）。","en_kjv":"And the LORD answered me, and said, Write the vision, and make it plain upon tables, that he may run that readeth it.","en_web":"Yahweh answered me, \"Write the vision, and make it plain on tablets, that he may run who reads it.","es_rvr1909":"Y Jehová me respondió, y dijo: Escribe la visión, y declárala en tablas, para que corra el que leyere en ella.","es_rvc":"Y el Señor me respondió, y me dijo: «Escribe esta visión. Grábala sobre unas tablillas, para que pueda leerse de corrido.","fr_nbs":"Le SEIGNEUR me répondit : Ecris la vision, grave-la sur les tablettes, afin qu’on puisse la lire couramment.","ja_jp":"主はわたしに答えて言われた、「この幻を書き、これを板の上に明らかにしるし、走りながらも、これを読みうるようにせよ。","ko_kor":"여호와께서 내게 대답하여 가라사대 너는 이 묵시를 기록하여 판에 명백히 새기되 달려 가면서도 읽을 수 있게 하라","vi_vie":"Đức Giê-hô-va đáp lại cũng ta mà rằng: Ngươi khá chép lấy sự hiện thấy, và rõ rệt nó ra trên bảng, hầu cho người đương chạy đọc được.","he_wlc":"וַיַּעֲנֵ֤נִי יְהוָה֙ וַיֹּ֔אמֶר כְּת֣וֹב חָז֔וֹן וּבָאֵ֖ר עַל ־ הַלֻּח֑וֹת לְמַ֥עַן יָר֖וּץ ק֥וֹרֵא בֽוֹ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"他","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"對我","s":["H6030"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"說","s":["H559"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"："},{"w":"將這默示","s":["H2377"]},{"w":"明明地","s":["H874"],"m":["8761"]},{"w":"寫","s":["H3789"],"m":["8798"]},{"w":"在","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"版上","s":["H3871"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"使","s":["H9001","H4616"]},{"w":"讀的人","s":["H7121"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"容易讀","s":["H9002"]},{"w":"（或譯：隨跑","s":["H7323"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"隨讀）。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"And the LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"answered","s":["H6030"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"me, and said","s":["H559"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":","},{"w":"Write","s":["H3789"],"m":["8798"]},{"w":"the vision","s":["H2377"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and make it plain","s":["H874"],"m":["8761"]},{"w":"upon tables","s":["H3871"]},{"w":","},{"w":"that he may run","s":["H7323"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"that readeth","s":["H7121"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"it."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"וַיַּעֲנֵ֤נִי","s":["H6030"]},{"w":"יְהוָה֙","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"וַיֹּ֔אמֶר","s":["H559"]},{"w":"כְּת֣וֹב","s":["H3789"]},{"w":"חָז֔וֹן","s":["H2377"]},{"w":"וּבָאֵ֖ר","s":["H874"]},{"w":"עַל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"־ הַלֻּח֑וֹת","s":["H3871"]},{"w":"לְמַ֥עַן","s":["H4616"]},{"w":"יָר֖וּץ","s":["H7323"]},{"w":"ק֥וֹרֵא","s":["H7121"]},{"w":"בֽוֹ ׃"}]}},{"s":3,"t":{"zh_unv":"因為這默示有一定的日期，快要應驗，並不虛謊。雖然遲延，還要等候；因為必然臨到，不再遲延。","en_kjv":"For the vision is yet for an appointed time, but at the end it shall speak, and not lie: though it tarry, wait for it; because it will surely come, it will not tarry.","en_web":"For the vision is yet for the appointed time, and it hurries toward the end, and won't prove false. Though it takes time, wait for it; because it will surely come. It won't delay.","es_rvr1909":"Aunque la visión tardará aún por tiempo, mas al fin hablará, y no mentirá: aunque se tardare, espéralo, que sin duda vendrá; no tardará.","es_rvc":"La visión va a tardar todavía algún tiempo, pero su cumplimiento se acerca, y no dejará de cumplirse. Aunque tarde, espera a que llegue, porque vendrá sin falta. No tarda ya.","fr_nbs":"Car c’est encore une vision pour le temps fixé, elle aspire à son terme, elle ne mentira pas. Si elle tarde, attends-la, car elle se réalisera bel et bien, elle ne sera pas différée.","ja_jp":"この幻はなお定められたときを待ち、終りをさして急いでいる。それは偽りではない。もしおそければ待っておれ。それは必ず臨む。滞りはしない。","ko_kor":"이 묵시는 정한 때가 있나니 그 종말이 속히 이르겠고 결코 거짓되지 아니하리라 비록 더딜지라도 기다리라 지체되지 않고 정녕 응하리라","vi_vie":"Vì sự hiện thấy còn phải ứng nghiệm trong kỳ nhứt định, sau cùng nó sẽ kíp đến, không phỉnh dối đâu; nếu nó chậm trễ, ngươi hãy đợi; bởi nó chắc sẽ đến, không chậm trễ.","he_wlc":"כִּ֣י ע֤וֹד חָזוֹן֙ לַמּוֹעֵ֔ד וְיָפֵ֥חַ לַקֵּ֖ץ וְלֹ֣א יְכַזֵּ֑ב אִם ־ יִתְמַהְמָהּ֙ חַכֵּה ־ ל֔וֹ כִּֽי ־ בֹ֥א יָבֹ֖א לֹ֥א יְאַחֵֽר ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"因為","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"這默示","s":["H2377"]},{"w":"有","s":["H5750"]},{"w":"一定的日期","s":["H9001","H4150"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"快要","s":["H9001","H7093"]},{"w":"應驗","s":["H6315"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"並不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"虛謊","s":["H3576"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"。"},{"w":"雖然","s":["H518"]},{"w":"遲延","s":["H4102"],"m":["8698"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"還要等候","s":["H2442","H9001"],"m":["8761"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"因為","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"必然","s":["H935"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"臨到","s":["H935"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"不再","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"遲延","s":["H309"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"For the vision","s":["H2377"]},{"w":"is yet for an appointed time","s":["H4150"],"i":1},{"w":","},{"w":"but at the end","s":["H7093"]},{"w":"it shall speak","s":["H6315"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and not lie","s":["H3576"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"though it tarry","s":["H4102"],"m":["8698"]},{"w":","},{"w":"wait","s":["H2442"],"m":["8761"]},{"w":"for it; because it will surely","s":["H935"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"come","s":["H935"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":","},{"w":"it will not tarry","s":["H309"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"כִּ֣י","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"ע֤וֹד","s":["H5750"]},{"w":"חָזוֹן֙","s":["H2377"]},{"w":"לַמּוֹעֵ֔ד","s":["H4150"]},{"w":"וְיָפֵ֥חַ","s":["H6315"]},{"w":"לַקֵּ֖ץ","s":["H7093"]},{"w":"וְלֹ֣א","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"יְכַזֵּ֑ב","s":["H3576"]},{"w":"אִם","s":["H518"]},{"w":"־ יִתְמַהְמָהּ֙","s":["H4102"]},{"w":"חַכֵּה","s":["H2442"]},{"w":"־ ל֔וֹ כִּֽי","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"־ בֹ֥א","s":["H935"]},{"w":"יָבֹ֖א","s":["H935"]},{"w":"לֹ֥א","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"יְאַחֵֽר","s":["H309"]},{"w":"׃"}]}},{"s":4,"t":{"zh_unv":"迦勒底人自高自大，心不正直；惟義人因信得生。","en_kjv":"Behold, his soul which is lifted up is not upright in him: but the just shall live by his faith.","en_web":"Behold, his soul is puffed up. It is not upright in him, but the righteous will live by his faith.","es_rvr1909":"He aquí se enorgullece aquel cuya alma no es derecha en él: mas el justo en su fe vivirá.","es_rvc":"Aquel cuya alma no es recta, es arrogante; pero el justo vivirá por su fe.","fr_nbs":"Son cœur se gonfle, il n’est pas droit ; mais le juste vivra en tenant ferme.","ja_jp":"見よ、その魂の正しくない者は衰える。しかし義人はその信仰によって生きる。","ko_kor":"보라, 그의 마음은 교만하며 그의 속에서 정직하지 못하니라 그러나 의인은 그 믿음으로 말미암아 살리라 !","vi_vie":"Nầy, lòng người kiêu ngạo, không có sự ngay thẳng trong nó; song người công bình thì sống bởi đức tin mình.","he_wlc":"הִנֵּ֣ה עֻפְּלָ֔ה לֹא ־ יָשְׁרָ֥ה נַפְשׁ֖וֹ בּ֑וֹ וְצַדִּ֖יק בֶּאֱמוּנָת֥וֹ יִחְיֶֽה ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"","s":["H2009"]},{"w":"迦勒底人自高自大","s":["H6075"],"m":["8795"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"心","s":["H5315"]},{"w":"不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"正直","s":["H3474","H9002"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"惟義人","s":["H6662"]},{"w":"因信","s":["H9002","H530"]},{"w":"得生","s":["H2421"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Behold, his soul","s":["H5315"]},{"w":"which is lifted up","s":["H6075"],"m":["8795"],"i":1},{"w":"is not upright","s":["H3474"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"in him: but the just","s":["H6662"]},{"w":"shall live","s":["H2421"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"by his faith","s":["H530"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"הִנֵּ֣ה","s":["H2009"]},{"w":"עֻפְּלָ֔ה","s":["H6075"]},{"w":"לֹא","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"־ יָשְׁרָ֥ה","s":["H3474"]},{"w":"נַפְשׁ֖וֹ","s":["H5315"]},{"w":"בּ֑וֹ וְצַדִּ֖יק","s":["H6662"]},{"w":"בֶּאֱמוּנָת֥וֹ","s":["H530"]},{"w":"יִחְיֶֽה","s":["H2421"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"p":1},{"s":5,"t":{"zh_unv":"迦勒底人因酒詭詐，狂傲，不住在家中，擴充心欲，好像陰間。他如死不能知足，聚集萬國，堆積萬民都歸自己。","en_kjv":"Yea also, because he transgresseth by wine, he is a proud man, neither keepeth at home, who enlargeth his desire as hell, and is as death, and cannot be satisfied, but gathereth unto him all nations, and heapeth unto him all people:","en_web":"Yes, moreover, wine is treacherous. A haughty man who doesn't stay at home, who enlarges his desire as Sheol, and he is like death, and can't be satisfied, but gathers to himself all nations, and heaps to himself all peoples.","es_rvr1909":"Y también, por cuanto peca por el vino, es un hombre soberbio, y no permanecerá: que ensanchó como el infierno su alma, y es como la muerte, que no se hartará: antes reunió á sí todas las gentes, y amontonó á sí todos los pueblos.","es_rvc":"El que es afecto al vino es traicionero y soberbio, y por lo tanto no permanecerá, pues ensancha su garganta como el sepulcro y es insaciable como la muerte; reúne para sí mismo a todos los pueblos y naciones.","fr_nbs":"Assurément, le vin est traître : l’homme hautain ne reste pas tranquille, il élargit son gosier comme le séjour des morts. Comme la mort, il est insatiable. Il attire à lui toutes les nations, il rassemble auprès de lui tous les peuples.","ja_jp":"また、酒は欺くものだ。高ぶる者は定まりがない。彼の欲は陰府のように広い。彼は死のようであって、飽くことなく、万国をおのれに集め、万民をおのれのものとしてつどわせる」。","ko_kor":"그는 술을 즐기며 궤휼하며 교만하여 가만히 있지 아니하고 그 욕심을 음부처럼 넓히며 또 그는 사망같아서 족한 줄을 모르고 자기에게로 만국을 모으며 만민을 모으나니","vi_vie":"Nó ghiền rượu, làm sự dối trá, kiêu ngạo và chẳng ở yên chỗ mình, mở rộng lòng ham mê nó như âm phủ, như sự chết chẳng được no chán; nó thâu góp mọi nước và hội hiệp mọi dân cho mình.","he_wlc":"וְאַף֙ כִּֽי ־ הַיַּ֣יִן בּוֹגֵ֔ד גֶּ֥בֶר יָהִ֖יר וְלֹ֣א יִנְוֶ֑ה אֲשֶׁר֩ הִרְחִ֨יב כִּשְׁא֜וֹל נַפְשׁ֗וֹ וְה֤וּא כַמָּ֨וֶת֙ וְלֹ֣א יִשְׂבָּ֔ע וַיֶּאֱסֹ֤ף אֵלָיו֙ כָּל ־ הַגּוֹיִ֔ם וַיִּקְבֹּ֥ץ אֵלָ֖יו כָּל ־ הָעַמִּֽים ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"","s":["H637"]},{"w":"迦勒底人","s":["H1397"]},{"w":"因","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"酒","s":["H3196"]},{"w":"詭詐","s":["H898"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"狂傲","s":["H3093"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"住在家中","s":["H5115"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，","s":["H834"]},{"w":"擴充","s":["H7337"],"m":["8689"]},{"w":"心欲","s":["H5315"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"好像陰間","s":["H9003","H7585"]},{"w":"。"},{"w":"他","s":["H1931"]},{"w":"如死","s":["H9003","H4194"]},{"w":"不能","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"知足","s":["H7646"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"聚集","s":["H622"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"萬","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"國","s":["H1471","H413"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"堆積","s":["H6908"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"萬","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"民","s":["H5971"]},{"w":"都歸自己","s":["H413"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Yea also, because he transgresseth","s":["H898"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"by wine","s":["H3196"]},{"w":","},{"w":"he is a proud","s":["H3093"]},{"w":"man","s":["H1397"]},{"w":","},{"w":"neither keepeth at home","s":["H5115"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":","},{"w":"who enlargeth","s":["H7337"],"m":["8689"]},{"w":"his desire","s":["H5315"]},{"w":"as hell","s":["H7585"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and is as death","s":["H4194"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and cannot be satisfied","s":["H7646"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":","},{"w":"but gathereth","s":["H622"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"unto him all nations","s":["H1471"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and heapeth","s":["H6908"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"unto him all people","s":["H5971"]},{"w":":"}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"וְאַף֙","s":["H637"]},{"w":"כִּֽי","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"־ הַיַּ֣יִן","s":["H3196"]},{"w":"בּוֹגֵ֔ד","s":["H898"]},{"w":"גֶּ֥בֶר","s":["H1397"]},{"w":"יָהִ֖יר","s":["H3093"]},{"w":"וְלֹ֣א","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"יִנְוֶ֑ה","s":["H5115"]},{"w":"אֲשֶׁר֩","s":["H834"]},{"w":"הִרְחִ֨יב","s":["H7337"]},{"w":"כִּשְׁא֜וֹל","s":["H7585"]},{"w":"נַפְשׁ֗וֹ","s":["H5315"]},{"w":"וְה֤וּא","s":["H1931"]},{"w":"כַמָּ֨וֶת֙","s":["H4194"]},{"w":"וְלֹ֣א","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"יִשְׂבָּ֔ע","s":["H7646"]},{"w":"וַיֶּאֱסֹ֤ף","s":["H622"]},{"w":"אֵלָיו֙","s":["H413"]},{"w":"כָּל","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"־ הַגּוֹיִ֔ם","s":["H1471"]},{"w":"וַיִּקְבֹּ֥ץ","s":["H6908"]},{"w":"אֵלָ֖יו","s":["H413"]},{"w":"כָּל","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"־ הָעַמִּֽים","s":["H5971"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["Yea...: or, How much more"]}},{"s":6,"t":{"zh_unv":"這些國的民豈不都要提起詩歌並俗語譏刺他說：禍哉！迦勒底人，你增添不屬自己的財物，多多取人的當頭，要到幾時為止呢？","en_kjv":"Shall not all these take up a parable against him, and a taunting proverb against him, and say, Woe to him that increaseth that which is not his! how long? and to him that ladeth himself with thick clay!","en_web":"Won't all these take up a parable against him, and a taunting proverb against him, and say, Woe to him who increases that which is not his, and who enriches himself by extortion! How long?'","es_rvr1909":"¿No han de levantar todos estos sobre él parábola, y sarcasmos contra él? Y dirán: ¡Ay del que multiplicó lo que no era suyo! ¿Y hasta cuándo había de amontonar sobre sí espeso lodo?","es_rvc":"»¿Y no habrán de burlarse de ti, y de lanzarte sarcásticos refranes? No faltarán quienes digan: “¡Ay de ti, que acumulabas bienes ajenos! ¿Hasta cuándo habrías de amontonar lo que a otros arrebataste?”","fr_nbs":"Tous ceux-là ne vont-ils pas faire de lui une fable, un sujet d’énigmes satiriques ? On dira : Quel malheur pour celui qui accumule ce qui n’est pas à lui — jusqu’à quand ? — et qui alourdit ses dettes !","ja_jp":"これらは皆ことわざをもって彼をあざけり、あざけりのなぞをもって彼をあざ笑わないだろうか。すなわち言う、「わざわいなるかな、おのれに属さないものを増し加える者よ。いつまでこのようであろうか。質物でおのれを重くする者よ」。","ko_kor":"그 무리가 다 속담으로 그를 평론하며 조롱하는 시로 그를 풍자하지 않겠느냐 ? 곧 이르기를 화 있을진저 ! 자기 소유 아닌 것을 모으는 자여 ! 언제까지 이르겠느냐 ? 볼모 잡은 것으로 무겁게 짐진 자여 !","vi_vie":"Chớ thì những kẻ đó há chẳng lấy thí dụ nhạo cười nó, lấy lời kín biếm nhẻ nó mà rằng: Khốn thay cho kẻ nhóm góp của chẳng thuộc về mình! Nó gánh vác của cầm rất nặng cho đến chừng nào?","he_wlc":"הֲלוֹא ־ אֵ֣לֶּה כֻלָּ֗ם עָלָיו֙ מָשָׁ֣ל יִשָּׂ֔אוּ וּמְלִיצָ֖ה חִיד֣וֹת ל֑וֹ וְיֹאמַ֗ר ה֚וֹי הַמַּרְבֶּ֣ה לֹּא ־ ל֔וֹ עַד ־ מָתַ֕י וּמַכְבִּ֥יד עָלָ֖יו עַבְטִֽיט ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"這些","s":["H428"]},{"w":"國的民豈不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"都","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"要","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"提起","s":["H5375"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"詩歌","s":["H4912"]},{"w":"並俗語","s":["H2420"]},{"w":"譏刺","s":["H4426"]},{"w":"他","s":["H9001"]},{"w":"說","s":["H559"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"："},{"w":"禍哉","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"！"},{"w":"迦勒底人，你增添","s":["H7235"],"m":["8688"]},{"w":"不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"屬自己","s":["H9001"]},{"w":"的財物，多多取","s":["H3513"],"m":["8688"]},{"w":"人的當頭","s":["H5671","H5921"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"要到","s":["H5704"]},{"w":"幾時","s":["H4970"]},{"w":"為止呢？"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Shall not all these take up","s":["H5375"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"a parable","s":["H4912"]},{"w":"against him, and a taunting","s":["H4426"]},{"w":"proverb","s":["H2420"]},{"w":"against him, and say","s":["H559"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":","},{"w":"Woe","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"to him that increaseth","s":["H7235"],"m":["8688"]},{"w":"that which is not his! how long? and to him that ladeth","s":["H3513"],"m":["8688"],"i":1},{"w":"himself with thick clay","s":["H5671"]},{"w":"!"}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"הֲלוֹא","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"־ אֵ֣לֶּה","s":["H428"]},{"w":"כֻלָּ֗ם","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"עָלָיו֙","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"מָשָׁ֣ל","s":["H4912"]},{"w":"יִשָּׂ֔אוּ","s":["H5375"]},{"w":"וּמְלִיצָ֖ה","s":["H4426"]},{"w":"חִיד֣וֹת","s":["H2420"]},{"w":"ל֑וֹ וְיֹאמַ֗ר","s":["H559"]},{"w":"ה֚וֹי","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"הַמַּרְבֶּ֣ה","s":["H7235"]},{"w":"לֹּא","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"־ ל֔וֹ עַד","s":["H5704"]},{"w":"־ מָתַ֕י","s":["H4970"]},{"w":"וּמַכְבִּ֥יד","s":["H3513"]},{"w":"עָלָ֖יו","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"עַבְטִֽיט","s":["H5671"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["Woe...: or, Ho, he"]}},{"s":7,"t":{"zh_unv":"咬傷你的豈不忽然起來，擾害你的豈不興起，你就作他們的擄物嗎？","en_kjv":"Shall they not rise up suddenly that shall bite thee, and awake that shall vex thee, and thou shalt be for booties unto them?","en_web":"Won't your debtors rise up suddenly, and wake up those who make you tremble, and you will be their victim?","es_rvr1909":"¿No se levantarán de repente los que te han de morder, y se despertarán los que te han de quitar de tu lugar, y serás á ellos por rapiña?","es_rvc":"»¿No habrán de levantarse de pronto tus deudores, y al despertar te harán temblar, y serás para ellos botín de guerra?","fr_nbs":"Tes créanciers ne vont-ils pas soudain se lever ? Ceux qui te secoueront ne vont-ils pas s’éveiller ? Tu deviendras leur butin !","ja_jp":"あなたの負債者は、にわかに興らないであろうか。あなたを激しくゆすぶる者は目ざめないであろうか。その時あなたは彼らにかすめられる。","ko_kor":"너를 물 자들이 홀연히 일어나지 않겠느냐 네가 그들에게 노략을 당하지 않겠느냐 ?","vi_vie":"Há chẳng sẽ có kẻ vụt dấy lên đặng cắn ngươi sao? Kẻ đuổi bắt ngươi há chẳng tỉnh thức sao? Ngươi sẽ bị nó cướp bóc.","he_wlc":"הֲל֣וֹא פֶ֗תַע יָק֨וּמוּ֙ נֹשְׁכֶ֔יךָ וְיִקְצ֖וּ מְזַעְזְעֶ֑יךָ וְהָיִ֥יתָ לִמְשִׁסּ֖וֹת לָֽמוֹ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"咬傷你的","s":["H5391"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"豈不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"忽然","s":["H6621"]},{"w":"起來","s":["H6965"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"擾害你的","s":["H2111"],"m":["8772"]},{"w":"豈不興起","s":["H3364"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"你就作","s":["H1961"]},{"w":"他們的","s":["H9001"]},{"w":"擄物","s":["H9001","H4933"]},{"w":"嗎？"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Shall they not rise up","s":["H6965"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"suddenly","s":["H6621"]},{"w":"that shall bite","s":["H5391"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"thee, and awake","s":["H3364"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"that shall vex","s":["H2111"],"m":["8772"]},{"w":"thee, and thou shalt be for booties","s":["H4933"]},{"w":"unto them?"}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"הֲל֣וֹא","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"פֶ֗תַע","s":["H6621"]},{"w":"יָק֨וּמוּ֙","s":["H6965"]},{"w":"נֹשְׁכֶ֔יךָ","s":["H5391"]},{"w":"וְיִקְצ֖וּ","s":["H6974"]},{"w":"מְזַעְזְעֶ֑יךָ","s":["H2111"]},{"w":"וְהָיִ֥יתָ","s":["H1961"]},{"w":"לִמְשִׁסּ֖וֹת","s":["H4933"]},{"w":"לָֽמוֹ ׃"}]}},{"s":8,"t":{"zh_unv":"因你搶奪許多的國，殺人流血，向國內的城並城中一切居民施行強暴，所以各國剩下的民都必搶奪你。","en_kjv":"Because thou hast spoiled many nations, all the remnant of the people shall spoil thee; because of men's blood, and for the violence of the land, of the city, and of all that dwell therein.","en_web":"Because you have plundered many nations, all the remnant of the peoples will plunder you, because of men's blood, and for the violence done to the land, to the city and to all who dwell in it.","es_rvr1909":"Porque tú has despojado muchas gentes, todos los otros pueblos te despojarán; á causa de las sangres humanas, y robos de la tierra, de las ciudades y de todos los que moraban en ellas.","es_rvc":"Tú has despojado de sus bienes a muchas naciones; por eso todos los otros pueblos te despojarán. Y es que tú has derramado mucha sangre, has cometido muchos robos en la tierra y en las ciudades, y contra todos sus habitantes.","fr_nbs":"Parce que tu as pillé une multitude de nations, tout le reste des peuples te pillera, à cause du sang humain, à cause de la violence faite au pays, à la ville et à tous ses habitants.","ja_jp":"あなたは多くの国民をかすめたゆえ、そのもろもろの民の残れる者は皆あなたをかすめる。これは人の血を流し、国と町と、その中に住むすべての者に暴虐を行ったからである。","ko_kor":"네가 여러 나라를 노략하였으므로 그 모든 민족의 남은 자가 너를 노략하리니 이는 네가 사람의 피를 흘렸음이요 또 땅에 성읍에 그 안의 모든 거민에게 강포를 행하였음이니라 하리라","vi_vie":"Vì ngươi đã cướp nhiều nước, thì cả phần sót lại của các dân sẽ cướp ngươi, vì cớ huyết người ta, vì sự bạo ngược làm ra cho đất, cho thành, và cho hết thảy dân cư nó.","he_wlc":"כִּֽי אַתָּ֤ה שַׁלּ֨וֹתָ֙ גּוֹיִ֣ם רַבִּ֔ים יְשָׁלּ֖וּךָ כָּל ־ יֶ֣תֶר עַמִּ֑ים מִדְּמֵ֤י אָדָם֙ וַחֲמַס ־ אֶ֔רֶץ קִרְיָ֖ה וְכָל ־ יֹ֥שְׁבֵי בָֽהּ ׃ פ"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"因","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"你","s":["H859"]},{"w":"搶奪","s":["H7997"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"許多","s":["H7227"]},{"w":"的國","s":["H1471"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"殺人","s":["H120"]},{"w":"流血","s":["H4480","H1818"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"向國內","s":["H776"]},{"w":"的城","s":["H7151"]},{"w":"並城中","s":["H9002"]},{"w":"一切","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"居民","s":["H3427"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"施行強暴","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"所以各國剩下","s":["H3499"]},{"w":"的民","s":["H5971"]},{"w":"都","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"必搶奪你","s":["H7997"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Because thou hast spoiled","s":["H7997"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"many","s":["H7227"]},{"w":"nations","s":["H1471"]},{"w":","},{"w":"all the remnant","s":["H3499"]},{"w":"of the people","s":["H5971"]},{"w":"shall spoil","s":["H7997"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"thee; because of men's","s":["H120"]},{"w":"blood","s":["H1818"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and for the violence","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"of the land","s":["H776"]},{"w":","},{"w":"of the city","s":["H7151"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and of all that dwell","s":["H3427"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"therein."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"כִּֽי","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"אַתָּ֤ה","s":["H859"]},{"w":"שַׁלּ֨וֹתָ֙","s":["H7997"]},{"w":"גּוֹיִ֣ם","s":["H1471"]},{"w":"רַבִּ֔ים","s":["H7227"]},{"w":"יְשָׁלּ֖וּךָ","s":["H7997"]},{"w":"כָּל","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"־ יֶ֣תֶר","s":["H3499"]},{"w":"עַמִּ֑ים","s":["H5971"]},{"w":"מִדְּמֵ֤י","s":["H1818"]},{"w":"אָדָם֙","s":["H120"]},{"w":"וַחֲמַס","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"־ אֶ֔רֶץ","s":["H776"]},{"w":"קִרְיָ֖ה","s":["H7151"]},{"w":"וְכָל","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"־ יֹ֥שְׁבֵי","s":["H3427"]},{"w":"בָֽהּ ׃ פ"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["blood: Heb. bloods"]}},{"s":9,"t":{"zh_unv":"為本家積蓄不義之財、在高處搭窩、指望免災的有禍了！","en_kjv":"Woe to him that coveteth an evil covetousness to his house, that he may set his nest on high, that he may be delivered from the power of evil!","en_web":"Woe to him who gets an evil gain for his house, that he may set his nest on high, that he may be delivered from the hand of evil!","es_rvr1909":"¡Ay del que codicia maligna codicia para su casa, por poner en alto su nido, por escaparse del poder del mal!","es_rvc":"»¡Ay de ti, que codicias ganancias injustas para tu casa, y que pones en alto tu nido para escaparte del poder del mal!","fr_nbs":"Quel malheur pour celui qui se fait un profit malhonnête pour sa maison, afin de placer son nid sur la hauteur, pour échapper au malheur !","ja_jp":"わざわいなるかな、災の手を免れるために高い所に巣を構えようと、おのが家のために不義の利を取る者よ。","ko_kor":"재앙을 피하기 위하여 높은데 깃들이려 하며 자기 집을 위하여 불의의 이를 취하는 자에게 화 있을찐저 !","vi_vie":"Khốn thay cho kẻ tìm lợi bất nghĩa cho nhà mình, để lót ổ mình trong nơi cao, để được cứu khỏi tay hung ác.","he_wlc":"ה֗וֹי בֹּצֵ֛עַ בֶּ֥צַע רָ֖ע לְבֵית֑וֹ לָשׂ֤וּם בַּמָּרוֹם֙ קִנּ֔וֹ לְהִנָּצֵ֖ל מִכַּף ־ רָֽע ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"","s":["H9002"]},{"w":"為本家","s":["H9001","H1004"]},{"w":"積蓄","s":["H1214"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"不義","s":["H7451"]},{"w":"之財","s":["H1215"]},{"w":"、"},{"w":"在高處","s":["H9002","H4791"]},{"w":"搭","s":["H9001","H7760"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"窩","s":["H7064"]},{"w":"、"},{"w":"指望","s":["H9001","H5337"],"m":["8736"]},{"w":"免","s":["H4480","H3709"]},{"w":"災","s":["H7451"]},{"w":"的有禍","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"了！"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Woe","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"to him that coveteth","s":["H1214"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"an evil","s":["H7451"]},{"w":"covetousness","s":["H1215"]},{"w":"to his house","s":["H1004"]},{"w":","},{"w":"that he may set","s":["H7760"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"his nest","s":["H7064"]},{"w":"on high","s":["H4791"]},{"w":","},{"w":"that he may be delivered","s":["H5337"],"m":["8736"]},{"w":"from the power","s":["H3709"]},{"w":"of evil","s":["H7451"]},{"w":"!"}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"ה֗וֹי","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"בֹּצֵ֛עַ","s":["H1214"]},{"w":"בֶּ֥צַע","s":["H1215"]},{"w":"רָ֖ע","s":["H7451"]},{"w":"לְבֵית֑וֹ","s":["H1004"]},{"w":"לָשׂ֤וּם","s":["H7760"]},{"w":"בַּמָּרוֹם֙","s":["H4791"]},{"w":"קִנּ֔וֹ","s":["H7064"]},{"w":"לְהִנָּצֵ֖ל","s":["H5337"]},{"w":"מִכַּף","s":["H3709"]},{"w":"־ רָֽע","s":["H7451"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["coveteth...: or, gaineth and evil gain","power...: Heb. palm of the hand"]}},{"s":10,"t":{"zh_unv":"你圖謀剪除多國的民，犯了罪，使你的家蒙羞，自害己命。","en_kjv":"Thou hast consulted shame to thy house by cutting off many people, and hast sinned against thy soul.","en_web":"You have devised shame to your house, by cutting off many peoples, and have sinned against your soul.","es_rvr1909":"Tomaste consejo vergonzoso para tu casa, asolaste muchos pueblos, y has pecado contra tu vida.","es_rvc":"Para vergüenza de tu casa, hiciste planes malvados, asolaste muchos pueblos, y has pecado contra tu vida.","fr_nbs":"C’est la honte de ta maison que tu as décidée ; en abattant une multitude de peuples, c’est contre toi-même que tu pèches.","ja_jp":"あなたは事をはかって自分の家に恥を招き、多くの民を滅ぼして、自分の生命を失った。","ko_kor":"네가 여러 민족을 멸한 것이 네 집에 욕을 부르며 너로 네 영혼에게 죄를 범하게 하는 것이 되었도다","vi_vie":"Ngươi đã dùng mưu xấu hổ cho nhà mình mà diệt nhiều dân tộc, ngươi đã phạm tội nghịch cùng linh hồn ngươi.","he_wlc":"יָעַ֥צְתָּ בֹּ֖שֶׁת לְבֵיתֶ֑ךָ קְצוֹת ־ עַמִּ֥ים רַבִּ֖ים וְחוֹטֵ֥א נַפְשֶֽׁךָ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"你圖謀","s":["H3289"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"剪除","s":["H7096"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"多","s":["H7227"]},{"w":"國的民","s":["H5971"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"犯了罪","s":["H2398"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"使你的家","s":["H9001","H1004"]},{"w":"蒙羞","s":["H1322"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"自害己命","s":["H5315"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Thou hast consulted","s":["H3289"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"shame","s":["H1322"]},{"w":"to thy house","s":["H1004"]},{"w":"by cutting off","s":["H7096"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"many","s":["H7227"]},{"w":"people","s":["H5971"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and hast sinned","s":["H2398"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"against thy soul","s":["H5315"],"i":1},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"יָעַ֥צְתָּ","s":["H3289"]},{"w":"בֹּ֖שֶׁת","s":["H1322"]},{"w":"לְבֵיתֶ֑ךָ","s":["H1004"]},{"w":"קְצוֹת","s":["H7096"]},{"w":"־ עַמִּ֥ים","s":["H5971"]},{"w":"רַבִּ֖ים","s":["H7227"]},{"w":"וְחוֹטֵ֥א","s":["H2398"]},{"w":"נַפְשֶֽׁךָ","s":["H5315"]},{"w":"׃"}]}},{"s":11,"t":{"zh_unv":"牆裡的石頭必呼叫；房內的棟樑必應聲。","en_kjv":"For the stone shall cry out of the wall, and the beam out of the timber shall answer it.","en_web":"For the stone will cry out of the wall, and the beam out of the woodwork will answer it.","es_rvr1909":"Porque la piedra clamará desde el muro, y la tabla del enmaderado le responderá.","es_rvc":"Ciertamente, las piedras de los muros clamarán contra ti, y las tablas del enmaderado repetirán el eco.","fr_nbs":"Car depuis le mur la pierre crie, et la poutre lui répond de la charpente.","ja_jp":"石は石がきから叫び、梁は建物からこれに答えるからである。","ko_kor":"담에서 돌이 부르짖고 집에서 들보가 응답하리라","vi_vie":"Vì đá trong vách sẽ kêu lên, rường trên mái sẽ đáp lại.","he_wlc":"כִּי ־ אֶ֖בֶן מִקִּ֣יר תִּזְעָ֑ק וְכָפִ֖יס מֵעֵ֥ץ יַעֲנֶֽנָּה ׃ פ"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"牆裡","s":["H4480","H7023"]},{"w":"的石頭","s":["H68"]},{"w":"必呼叫","s":["H2199"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"房內","s":["H4480","H6086"]},{"w":"的棟樑","s":["H3714"]},{"w":"必應聲","s":["H6030"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"For the stone","s":["H68"]},{"w":"shall cry out","s":["H2199"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"of the wall","s":["H7023"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and the beam out","s":["H3714"]},{"w":"of the timber","s":["H6086"]},{"w":"shall answer","s":["H6030"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"it."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"כִּי","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"־ אֶ֖בֶן","s":["H68"]},{"w":"מִקִּ֣יר","s":["H7023"]},{"w":"תִּזְעָ֑ק","s":["H2199"]},{"w":"וְכָפִ֖יס","s":["H3714"]},{"w":"מֵעֵ֥ץ","s":["H6086"]},{"w":"יַעֲנֶֽנָּה","s":["H6030"]},{"w":"׃ פ"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["beam: or, piece, or, fastening","answer it: or, witness against it"]}},{"s":12,"t":{"zh_unv":"以人血建城、以罪孽立邑的有禍了！","en_kjv":"Woe to him that buildeth a town with blood, and stablisheth a city by iniquity!","en_web":"Woe to him who builds a town with blood, and establishes a city by iniquity!","es_rvr1909":"¡Ay del que edifica la ciudad con sangres, y del que funda la villa con iniquidad!","es_rvc":"»¡Ay de ti, que edificas la ciudad con sangre, y que la fundas sobre la iniquidad!","fr_nbs":"Quel malheur pour celui qui bâtit une ville par le sang, qui fonde une cité par l’injustice !","ja_jp":"わざわいなるかな、血をもって町を建て、悪をもって町を築く者よ。","ko_kor":"피로 읍을 건설하며 불의로 성을 건축하는 자에게 화 있을진저 !","vi_vie":"Khốn thay cho kẻ lấy huyết dựng ấp, và lấy sự gian ác xây thành!","he_wlc":"ה֛וֹי בֹּנֶ֥ה עִ֖יר בְּדָמִ֑ים וְכוֹנֵ֥ן קִרְיָ֖ה בְּעַוְלָֽה ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"以人血","s":["H9002","H1818"]},{"w":"建","s":["H1129"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"城","s":["H5892"]},{"w":"、"},{"w":"以罪孽","s":["H9002","H5766"]},{"w":"立","s":["H3559"],"m":["8790"]},{"w":"邑","s":["H7151"]},{"w":"的有禍","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"了！"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Woe","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"to him that buildeth","s":["H1129"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"a town","s":["H5892"]},{"w":"with blood","s":["H1818"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and stablisheth","s":["H3559"],"m":["8790"]},{"w":"a city","s":["H7151"]},{"w":"by iniquity","s":["H5766"]},{"w":"!"}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"ה֛וֹי","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"בֹּנֶ֥ה","s":["H1129"]},{"w":"עִ֖יר","s":["H5892"]},{"w":"בְּדָמִ֑ים","s":["H1818"]},{"w":"וְכוֹנֵ֥ן","s":["H3559"]},{"w":"קִרְיָ֖ה","s":["H7151"]},{"w":"בְּעַוְלָֽה","s":["H5766"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["blood: Heb. bloods"]}},{"s":13,"t":{"zh_unv":"眾民所勞碌得來的被火焚燒，列國由勞乏而得的歸於虛空，不都是出於萬軍之耶和華嗎？","en_kjv":"Behold, is it not of the LORD of hosts that the people shall labour in the very fire, and the people shall weary themselves for very vanity?","en_web":"Behold, isn't it of Yahweh of Armies that the peoples labor for the fire, and the nations weary themselves for vanity?","es_rvr1909":"¿No es esto de Jehová de los ejércitos? Los pueblos pues trabajarán para el fuego, y las gentes se fatigarán en vano.","es_rvc":"¿Acaso no lo ha determinado el Señor de los ejércitos? Los pueblos trabajarán para el fuego, y las naciones se fatigarán en vano.","fr_nbs":"N’est-ce pas du SEIGNEUR (YHWH) des Armées que vient ceci : les peuples se fatiguent pour du feu, les nations s’épuisent pour rien ?","ja_jp":"見よ、もろもろの民は火のために労し、もろもろの国びとはむなしい事のために疲れる。これは万軍の主から出る言葉ではないか。","ko_kor":"민족들이 불탈 것으로 수고하는 것과 열국이 헛된 일로 곤비하게 되는 것이 만군의 여호와께로서 말미암음이 아니냐 ?","vi_vie":"Phải, ấy há chẳng phải bởi Đức Giê-hô-va vạn quân mà các dân làm việc cho lửa, và các nước nhọc nhằn cho sự hư không hay sao?","he_wlc":"הֲל֣וֹא הִנֵּ֔ה מֵאֵ֖ת יְהוָ֣ה צְבָא֑וֹת וְיִֽיגְע֤וּ עַמִּים֙ בְּדֵי ־ אֵ֔שׁ וּלְאֻמִּ֖ים בְּדֵי ־ רִ֥יק יִעָֽפוּ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"","s":["H2009"]},{"w":"眾民","s":["H5971"]},{"w":"所勞碌","s":["H3021"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"得來的被火","s":["H9002","H1767","H784"]},{"w":"焚燒，列國","s":["H3816"]},{"w":"由勞乏","s":["H3286"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"而得的歸於","s":["H9002","H1767"]},{"w":"虛空","s":["H7385"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"不都是","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"出於","s":["H4480","H854"]},{"w":"萬軍","s":["H6635"]},{"w":"之耶和華","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"嗎？"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Behold, is it not of the LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"of hosts","s":["H6635"]},{"w":"that the people","s":["H5971"]},{"w":"shall labour","s":["H3021"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"in the very","s":["H1767"]},{"w":"fire","s":["H784"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and the people","s":["H3816"]},{"w":"shall weary","s":["H3286"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"themselves for very","s":["H1767"]},{"w":"vanity","s":["H7385"]},{"w":"?"}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"הֲל֣וֹא","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"הִנֵּ֔ה","s":["H2009"]},{"w":"מֵאֵ֖ת","s":["H854"]},{"w":"יְהוָ֣ה","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"צְבָא֑וֹת","s":["H6635"]},{"w":"וְיִֽיגְע֤וּ","s":["H3021"]},{"w":"עַמִּים֙","s":["H5971"]},{"w":"בְּדֵי","s":["H1767"]},{"w":"־ אֵ֔שׁ","s":["H784"]},{"w":"וּלְאֻמִּ֖ים","s":["H3816"]},{"w":"בְּדֵי","s":["H1767"]},{"w":"־ רִ֥יק","s":["H7385"]},{"w":"יִעָֽפוּ","s":["H3286"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["for...: or, in vain?"]}},{"s":14,"t":{"zh_unv":"認識耶和華榮耀的知識要充滿遍地，好像水充滿洋海一般。","en_kjv":"For the earth shall be filled with the knowledge of the glory of the LORD, as the waters cover the sea.","en_web":"For the earth will be filled with the knowledge of the glory of Yahweh, as the waters cover the sea.","es_rvr1909":"Porque la tierra será llena de conocimiento de la gloria de Jehová, como las aguas cubren la mar.","es_rvc":"Porque así como el mar rebosa de agua, también la tierra rebosará con el conocimiento de la gloria del Señor.","fr_nbs":"Car la terre sera remplie de la connaissance de la gloire du SEIGNEUR comme les eaux recouvrent la mer.","ja_jp":"海が水でおおわれているように、地は主の栄光の知識で満たされるからである。","ko_kor":"대저 물이 바다를 덮음 같이 여호와의 영광을 인정하는 것이 세상에 가득하리라","vi_vie":"Vì sự nhận biết vinh quang Đức Giê-hô-va sẽ đầy dẫy khắp đất như nước đầy tràn biển.","he_wlc":"כִּ֚י תִּמָּלֵ֣א הָאָ֔רֶץ לָדַ֖עַת אֶת ־ כְּב֣וֹד יְהוָ֑ה כַּמַּ֖יִם יְכַסּ֥וּ עַל ־ יָֽם ׃ ס"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"認識耶和華","s":["H3068","H853"]},{"w":"榮耀","s":["H3519"]},{"w":"的知識","s":["H9001","H3045"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"要充滿","s":["H4390"],"m":["8735"]},{"w":"遍地","s":["H776"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"好像水","s":["H9003","H4325"]},{"w":"充滿","s":["H3680","H5921"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"洋海","s":["H3220"]},{"w":"一般。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"For the earth","s":["H776"]},{"w":"shall be filled","s":["H4390"],"m":["8735"]},{"w":"with the knowledge","s":["H3045"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"of the glory","s":["H3519"]},{"w":"of the LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"w":","},{"w":"as the waters","s":["H4325"]},{"w":"cover","s":["H3680"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"the sea","s":["H3220"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"כִּ֚י","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"תִּמָּלֵ֣א","s":["H4390"]},{"w":"הָאָ֔רֶץ","s":["H776"]},{"w":"לָדַ֖עַת","s":["H3045"]},{"w":"אֶת","s":["H853"]},{"w":"־ כְּב֣וֹד","s":["H3519"]},{"w":"יְהוָ֑ה","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"כַּמַּ֖יִם","s":["H4325"]},{"w":"יְכַסּ֥וּ","s":["H3680"]},{"w":"עַל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"־ יָֽם","s":["H3220"]},{"w":"׃ ס"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["with...: or, by knowing the glory"]},"p":1},{"s":15,"t":{"zh_unv":"給人酒喝、又加上毒物、使他喝醉、好看見他下體的有禍了！","en_kjv":"Woe unto him that giveth his neighbour drink, that puttest thy bottle to him , and makest him drunken also, that thou mayest look on their nakedness!","en_web":"\"Woe to him who gives his neighbor drink, pouring your inflaming wine until they are drunk, so that you may gaze at their naked bodies!","es_rvr1909":"¡Ay del que da de beber á sus compañeros, que les acercas tu hiel y embriagas, para mirar sus desnudeces!","es_rvc":"»¡Ay de ti, que embriagas a tu prójimo! ¡Ay de ti, que le acercas el odre y lo emborrachas para contemplar su desnudez!","fr_nbs":"Quel malheur pour celui qui fait boire son prochain, — toi qui verses ton poison et qui l’enivres — afin de voir sa nudité !","ja_jp":"わざわいなるかな、その隣り人に怒りの杯を飲ませて、これを酔わせ、彼らの隠し所を見ようとする者よ。","ko_kor":"이웃에게 술을 마시우되 자기의 분노를 더하여 그로 취케 하고 그 하체를 드러 내려 하는 자에게 화 있을진저 !","vi_vie":"Khốn thay cho kẻ pha đồ độc cho người lân cận mình uống, làm cho nó say, đặng xem sự lõa lồ nó!","he_wlc":"ה֚וֹי מַשְׁקֵ֣ה רֵעֵ֔הוּ מְסַפֵּ֥חַ חֲמָתְךָ֖ וְאַ֣ף שַׁכֵּ֑ר לְמַ֥עַן הַבִּ֖יט עַל ־ מְעוֹרֵיהֶֽם ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"給人","s":["H7453"]},{"w":"酒喝","s":["H8248"],"m":["8688"]},{"w":"、"},{"w":"又加上","s":["H5596"],"m":["8764"]},{"w":"毒物","s":["H2534"]},{"w":"、"},{"w":"使他喝醉","s":["H637","H7937"],"m":["8763"]},{"w":"、"},{"w":"好","s":["H9001","H4616"]},{"w":"看見","s":["H5027","H5921"],"m":["8687"]},{"w":"他下體","s":["H4589"]},{"w":"的有禍","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"了！"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Woe","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"unto him that giveth his neighbour","s":["H7453"]},{"w":"drink","s":["H8248"],"m":["8688"]},{"w":","},{"w":"that puttest","s":["H5596"],"m":["8764"]},{"w":"thy bottle","s":["H2573"]},{"w":"to him , and makest him drunken","s":["H7937"],"m":["8763"]},{"w":"also, that thou mayest look","s":["H5027"],"m":["8687"]},{"w":"on their nakedness","s":["H4589"]},{"w":"!"}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"ה֚וֹי","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"מַשְׁקֵ֣ה","s":["H8248"]},{"w":"רֵעֵ֔הוּ","s":["H7453"]},{"w":"מְסַפֵּ֥חַ","s":["H5596"]},{"w":"חֲמָתְךָ֖","s":["H2573"]},{"w":"וְאַ֣ף","s":["H637"]},{"w":"שַׁכֵּ֑ר","s":["H7937"]},{"w":"לְמַ֥עַן","s":["H4616"]},{"w":"הַבִּ֖יט","s":["H5027"]},{"w":"עַל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"־ מְעוֹרֵיהֶֽם","s":["H4589"]},{"w":"׃"}]}},{"s":16,"t":{"zh_unv":"你滿受羞辱，不得榮耀；你也喝吧，顯出是未受割禮的！耶和華右手的杯必傳到你那裡；你的榮耀就變為大大地羞辱。","en_kjv":"Thou art filled with shame for glory: drink thou also, and let thy foreskin be uncovered: the cup of the LORD'S right hand shall be turned unto thee, and shameful spewing shall be on thy glory.","en_web":"You are filled with shame, and not glory. You will also drink, and be exposed! The cup of Yahweh's right hand will come around to you, and disgrace will cover your glory.","es_rvr1909":"Haste llenado de deshonra más que de honra: bebe tú también, y serás descubierto; el cáliz de la mano derecha de Jehová volverá sobre ti, y vómito de afrenta sobre tu gloria.","es_rvc":"Eso, en vez de honrarte, te llena de deshonra, ¡pero también tú beberás y mostrarás tu desnudez! El Señor mismo vendrá a ti, y con su mano derecha te dará a beber del cáliz, y tu honra quedará cubierta de afrentoso vómito.","fr_nbs":"Tu t’es rassasié de mépris plutôt que de gloire ; bois, toi aussi, et mets-toi à nu ! La coupe de la main droite du SEIGNEUR reviendra à toi : mépris sur ta gloire !","ja_jp":"あなたは誉の代りに恥に飽き、あなたもまた飲んでよろめけ。主の右の手の杯は、あなたに巡り来る。恥はあなたの誉に代る。","ko_kor":"네게 영광이 아니요 수치가 가득한즉 너도 마시고 너의 할례 아니한 것을 드러내라 여호와의 오른손의 잔이 네게로 돌아올 것이라 더러운 욕이 네 영광을 가리우리라","vi_vie":"Ngươi đầy sự sỉ nhục mà chẳng đầy sự vinh hiển. Ngươi cũng hãy uống đi, và làm như người chưa chịu phép cắt bì. Chén của Đức Giê-hô-va cầm trong tay hữu sẽ đến phiên trao cho ngươi, và sự nhuốc nha sẽ đổ ra trên sự vinh hiển ngươi.","he_wlc":"שָׂבַ֤עְתָּ קָלוֹן֙ מִכָּב֔וֹד שְׁתֵ֥ה גַם ־ אַ֖תָּה וְהֵֽעָרֵ֑ל תִּסּ֣וֹב עָלֶ֗יךָ כּ֚וֹס יְמִ֣ין יְהוָ֔ה וְקִיקָל֖וֹן עַל ־ כְּבוֹדֶֽךָ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"你滿受","s":["H7646"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"羞辱","s":["H7036"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"不得榮耀","s":["H4480","H3519"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"你","s":["H859"]},{"w":"也","s":["H1571"]},{"w":"喝吧","s":["H8354"],"m":["8798"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"顯出是未受割禮的","s":["H6188"],"m":["8734"]},{"w":"！"},{"w":"耶和華","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"右手","s":["H3225"]},{"w":"的杯","s":["H3563"]},{"w":"必傳","s":["H5437"],"m":["8735"]},{"w":"到你那裡","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"；","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"你的榮耀","s":["H3519"]},{"w":"就變為大大地羞辱","s":["H7022"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Thou art filled","s":["H7646"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"with shame","s":["H7036"]},{"w":"for glory","s":["H3519"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"drink","s":["H8354"],"m":["8798"]},{"w":"thou also, and let thy foreskin be uncovered","s":["H6188"],"m":["8734"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"the cup","s":["H3563"]},{"w":"of the LORD'S","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"right hand","s":["H3225"]},{"w":"shall be turned","s":["H5437"],"m":["8735"]},{"w":"unto thee, and shameful spewing","s":["H7022"]},{"w":"shall be on thy glory","s":["H3519"],"i":1},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"שָׂבַ֤עְתָּ","s":["H7646"]},{"w":"קָלוֹן֙","s":["H7036"]},{"w":"מִכָּב֔וֹד","s":["H3519"]},{"w":"שְׁתֵ֥ה","s":["H8354"]},{"w":"גַם","s":["H1571"]},{"w":"־ אַ֖תָּה","s":["H859"]},{"w":"וְהֵֽעָרֵ֑ל","s":["H6188"]},{"w":"תִּסּ֣וֹב","s":["H5437"]},{"w":"עָלֶ֗יךָ","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"כּ֚וֹס","s":["H3563"]},{"w":"יְמִ֣ין","s":["H3225"]},{"w":"יְהוָ֔ה","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"וְקִיקָל֖וֹן","s":["H7022"]},{"w":"עַל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"־ כְּבוֹדֶֽךָ","s":["H3519"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["with...: or, more with shame than with glory"]}},{"s":17,"t":{"zh_unv":"你向黎巴嫩行強暴與殘害驚嚇野獸的事必遮蓋你；因你殺人流血，向國內的城並城中一切居民施行強暴。","en_kjv":"For the violence of Lebanon shall cover thee, and the spoil of beasts, which made them afraid, because of men's blood, and for the violence of the land, of the city, and of all that dwell therein.","en_web":"For the violence done to Lebanon will overwhelm you, and the destruction of the animals, which made them afraid; because of men's blood, and for the violence done to the land, to every city and to those who dwell in them.","es_rvr1909":"Porque la rapiña del Líbano caerá sobre ti, y la destrucción de las fieras lo quebrantará; á causa de las sangres humanas, y del robo de la tierra, de las ciudades, y de todos los que en ellas moraban.","es_rvc":"Ciertamente, la rapiña del Líbano recaerá sobre ti, y las fieras te despedazarán. Y es que tú has derramado mucha sangre, has cometido muchos robos en la tierra y en las ciudades, y contra todos sus habitantes.","fr_nbs":"Car la violence faite au Liban t’étouffera, et ce que tes troupeaux auront ravagé les terrifiera, à cause du sang humain, à cause de la violence faite au pays, à la ville et à ses habitants.","ja_jp":"あなたがレバノンになした暴虐は、あなたを倒し、獣のような滅亡は、あなたを恐れさせる。これは人の血を流し、国と町と、町の中に住むすべての者に、暴虐を行ったからである。","ko_kor":"대저 네가 레바논에 강포를 행한 것과 짐승을 두렵게하여 잔해한 것 곧 사람의 피를 흘리며 땅과 성읍과 그 모든 거민에게 강포를 행한 것이 네게로 돌아오리라","vi_vie":"Vì sự bạo ngược đã làm ra cho Li-ban sẽ che phủ ngươi, và sự tàn hại các loài thú làm cho nó kinh sợ, lại vì cớ huyết người ta, vì sự bạo ngược làm ra cho đất, cho thành, và cho hết thảy dân cư nó.","he_wlc":"כִּ֣י חֲמַ֤ס לְבָנוֹן֙ יְכַסֶּ֔ךָּ וְשֹׁ֥ד בְּהֵמ֖וֹת יְחִיתַ֑ן מִדְּמֵ֤י אָדָם֙ וַחֲמַס ־ אֶ֔רֶץ קִרְיָ֖ה וְכָל ־ יֹ֥שְׁבֵי בָֽהּ ׃ ס"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"你向黎巴嫩","s":["H3844"]},{"w":"行強暴","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"與殘害","s":["H7701"]},{"w":"驚嚇","s":["H2865"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"野獸","s":["H929"]},{"w":"的事必遮蓋你","s":["H3680"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"因你殺人","s":["H120"]},{"w":"流血","s":["H4480","H1818"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"向國內","s":["H776"]},{"w":"的城","s":["H7151"]},{"w":"並城中","s":["H9002"]},{"w":"一切","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"居民","s":["H3427"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"施行強暴","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"For the violence","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"of Lebanon","s":["H3844"]},{"w":"shall cover","s":["H3680"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"thee, and the spoil","s":["H7701"]},{"w":"of beasts","s":["H929"]},{"w":","},{"w":"which made them afraid","s":["H2865"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":","},{"w":"because of men's","s":["H120"]},{"w":"blood","s":["H1818"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and for the violence","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"of the land","s":["H776"]},{"w":","},{"w":"of the city","s":["H7151"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and of all that dwell","s":["H3427"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"therein."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"כִּ֣י","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"חֲמַ֤ס","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"לְבָנוֹן֙","s":["H3844"]},{"w":"יְכַסֶּ֔ךָּ","s":["H3680"]},{"w":"וְשֹׁ֥ד","s":["H7701"]},{"w":"בְּהֵמ֖וֹת","s":["H929"]},{"w":"יְחִיתַ֑ן","s":["H2865"]},{"w":"מִדְּמֵ֤י","s":["H1818"]},{"w":"אָדָם֙","s":["H120"]},{"w":"וַחֲמַס","s":["H2555"]},{"w":"־ אֶ֔רֶץ","s":["H776"]},{"w":"קִרְיָ֖ה","s":["H7151"]},{"w":"וְכָל","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"־ יֹ֥שְׁבֵי","s":["H3427"]},{"w":"בָֽהּ ׃ ס"}]}},{"s":18,"t":{"zh_unv":"雕刻的偶像，人將它刻出來，有甚麼益處呢？鑄造的偶像就是虛謊的師傅。製造者倚靠這啞巴偶像有甚麼益處呢？","en_kjv":"What profiteth the graven image that the maker thereof hath graven it; the molten image, and a teacher of lies, that the maker of his work trusteth therein, to make dumb idols?","en_web":"\"What value does the engraved image have, that its maker has engraved it; the molten image, even the teacher of lies, that he who fashions its form trusts in it, to make mute idols?","es_rvr1909":"¿De qué sirve la escultura que esculpió el que la hizo? ¿la estatua de fundición, que enseña mentira, para que haciendo imágenes mudas confíe el hacedor en su obra?","es_rvc":"»¿De qué sirve la escultura que hace el escultor? ¿De que sirve la estatua fundida, maestra de mentira, obra en la que pone su confianza el que hace imágenes mudas?","fr_nbs":"A quoi sert une statue, pour que l’artisan la taille ? — une idole de métal fondu, qui enseigne le mensonge, pour que l’artisan qui la façonne mette sa confiance en elle, faisant ainsi des faux dieux muets ?","ja_jp":"刻める像、鋳像および偽りを教える者は、その作者がこれを刻んだとてなんの益があろうか。その作者が物言わぬ偶像を造って、その造ったものに頼んでみても、なんの益があろうか。","ko_kor":"새긴 우상은 그 새겨 만든 자에게 무엇이 유익하겠느냐 ? 부어 만든 우상은 거짓 스승이라 만든 자가 이 말하지 못하는 우상을 의지하니 무엇이 유익하겠느냐 ?","vi_vie":"Tượng chạm mà thợ đã chạm ra, có ích gì cho nó chăng? Tượng đúc, là thầy giả dối, thi có ích gì, mà người thợ làm thần tượng câm ấy lại tin cậy nơi việc mình làm ra?","he_wlc":"מָֽה ־ הוֹעִ֣יל פֶּ֗סֶל כִּ֤י פְסָלוֹ֙ יֹֽצְר֔וֹ מַסֵּכָ֖ה וּמ֣וֹרֶה שָּׁ֑קֶר כִּ֣י בָטַ֞ח יֹצֵ֤ר יִצְרוֹ֙ עָלָ֔יו לַעֲשׂ֖וֹת אֱלִילִ֥ים אִלְּמִֽים ׃ ס"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"雕刻的偶像","s":["H6459"]},{"w":"，","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"人","s":["H3335"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"將它刻","s":["H6458"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"出來，有甚麼","s":["H4100"]},{"w":"益處","s":["H3276"],"m":["8689"]},{"w":"呢？鑄造的偶像","s":["H4541"]},{"w":"就是虛謊","s":["H8267"]},{"w":"的師傅","s":["H3384"],"m":["8688"]},{"w":"。","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"製造者","s":["H3335","H3336"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"倚靠","s":["H982","H5921"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"這","s":["H9001","H6213"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"啞巴","s":["H483"]},{"w":"偶像","s":["H457"]},{"w":"有甚麼益處呢？"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"What profiteth","s":["H3276"],"m":["8689"]},{"w":"the graven image","s":["H6459"]},{"w":"that the maker","s":["H3335"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"thereof hath graven","s":["H6458"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"it; the molten image","s":["H4541"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and a teacher","s":["H3384"],"m":["8688"]},{"w":"of lies","s":["H8267"]},{"w":","},{"w":"that the maker","s":["H3335"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"of his work","s":["H3336"]},{"w":"trusteth","s":["H982"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"therein, to make","s":["H6213"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"dumb","s":["H483"]},{"w":"idols","s":["H457"]},{"w":"?"}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"מָֽה","s":["H4100"]},{"w":"־ הוֹעִ֣יל","s":["H3276"]},{"w":"פֶּ֗סֶל","s":["H6459"]},{"w":"כִּ֤י","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"פְסָלוֹ֙","s":["H6458"]},{"w":"יֹֽצְר֔וֹ","s":["H3336"]},{"w":"מַסֵּכָ֖ה","s":["H4541"]},{"w":"וּמ֣וֹרֶה","s":["H3384"]},{"w":"שָּׁ֑קֶר","s":["H8267"]},{"w":"כִּ֣י","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"בָטַ֞ח","s":["H982"]},{"w":"יֹצֵ֤ר","s":["H3335"]},{"w":"יִצְרוֹ֙","s":["H3336"]},{"w":"עָלָ֔יו","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"לַעֲשׂ֖וֹת","s":["H6213"]},{"w":"אֱלִילִ֥ים","s":["H457"]},{"w":"אִלְּמִֽים","s":["H483"]},{"w":"׃ ס"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["maker of...: Heb. fashioner of his fashion"]}},{"s":19,"t":{"zh_unv":"對木偶說：醒起！對啞巴石像說：起來！那人有禍了！這個還能教訓人嗎？看哪，是包裹金銀的，其中毫無氣息。","en_kjv":"Woe unto him that saith to the wood, Awake; to the dumb stone, Arise, it shall teach! Behold, it is laid over with gold and silver, and there is no breath at all in the midst of it.","en_web":"Woe to him who says to the wood, Awake!' or to the mute stone, Arise!' Shall this teach? Behold, it is overlaid with gold and silver, and there is no breath at all in the midst of it.","es_rvr1909":"¡Ay del que dice al palo: Despiértate; y á la piedra muda: Levántate! ¿Podrá él enseñar? He aquí él está cubierto de oro y plata, y no hay dentro de él espíritu.","es_rvc":"¡Ay del que pide al palo que despierte, y que a la piedra muda le pide levantarse! ¿Cómo pretende ser maestro? ¡Sus imágenes están recubiertas de oro y plata, y no hay en ellas ningún hálito de vida!»","fr_nbs":"Quel malheur pour celui qui dit à un morceau de bois : « Lève-toi ! », à une pierre silencieuse : « Eveille-toi ! » — Va-t-elle enseigner ? Elle est plaquée d’or et d’argent, mais, en elle, pas le moindre souffle.","ja_jp":"わざわいなるかな、木に向かって、さめよと言い、物言わぬ石に向かって、起きよと言う者よ。これは黙示を与え得ようか。見よ、これは金銀をきせたもので、その中には命の息は少しもない。","ko_kor":"나무더러 깨라 하며 말하지 못하는 돌더러 일어나라 하는 자에게 화 있을진저 ! 그 이는 금과 은으로 입힌 것인즉 그 속에는 생기가 도무지 없느니라","vi_vie":"Khốn tay cho kẻ nói với gỗ rằng: Hãy tỉnh thức! và với đá câm rằng: Hãy chổi dậy! Nó có dạy dỗ được chăng? nầy, nó là bọc vàng và bạc, song chẳng có một chút hơi thổ nào ở giữa nó.","he_wlc":"ה֣וֹי אֹמֵ֤ר לָעֵץ֙ הָקִ֔יצָה ע֖וּרִי לְאֶ֣בֶן דּוּמָ֑ם ה֣וּא יוֹרֶ֔ה הִנֵּה ־ ה֗וּא תָּפוּשׂ֙ זָהָ֣ב וָכֶ֔סֶף וְכָל ־ ר֖וּחַ אֵ֥ין בְּקִרְבּֽוֹ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"對木偶","s":["H9001","H6086"]},{"w":"說：醒起","s":["H6974"],"m":["8685"]},{"w":"！"},{"w":"對啞巴","s":["H1748"]},{"w":"石像","s":["H9001","H68"]},{"w":"說","s":["H559"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"："},{"w":"起來","s":["H5782"],"m":["8798"]},{"w":"！"},{"w":"那人有禍","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"了！這個","s":["H1931"]},{"w":"還能教訓","s":["H3384"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"人嗎？看哪","s":["H2009"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"是","s":["H1931"]},{"w":"包裹","s":["H8610"],"m":["8803"]},{"w":"金","s":["H2091"]},{"w":"銀","s":["H3701"]},{"w":"的，其中","s":["H9002","H7130"]},{"w":"毫","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"無","s":["H369"]},{"w":"氣息","s":["H7307"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Woe","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"unto him that saith","s":["H559"],"m":["8802"]},{"w":"to the wood","s":["H6086"]},{"w":","},{"w":"Awake","s":["H6974"],"m":["8685"]},{"w":";"},{"w":"to the dumb","s":["H1748"]},{"w":"stone","s":["H68"]},{"w":","},{"w":"Arise","s":["H5782"],"m":["8798"]},{"w":","},{"w":"it shall teach","s":["H3384"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"!"},{"w":"Behold, it is laid","s":["H8610"],"m":["8803"]},{"w":"over with gold","s":["H2091"]},{"w":"and silver","s":["H3701"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and there is no breath","s":["H7307"]},{"w":"at all in the midst","s":["H7130"]},{"w":"of it."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"ה֣וֹי","s":["H1945"]},{"w":"אֹמֵ֤ר","s":["H559"]},{"w":"לָעֵץ֙","s":["H6086"]},{"w":"הָקִ֔יצָה","s":["H6974"]},{"w":"ע֖וּרִי","s":["H5782"]},{"w":"לְאֶ֣בֶן","s":["H68"]},{"w":"דּוּמָ֑ם","s":["H1748"]},{"w":"ה֣וּא","s":["H1931"]},{"w":"יוֹרֶ֔ה","s":["H3384"]},{"w":"הִנֵּה","s":["H2009"]},{"w":"־ ה֗וּא","s":["H1931"]},{"w":"תָּפוּשׂ֙","s":["H8610"]},{"w":"זָהָ֣ב","s":["H2091"]},{"w":"וָכֶ֔סֶף","s":["H3701"]},{"w":"וְכָל","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"־ ר֖וּחַ","s":["H7307"]},{"w":"אֵ֥ין","s":["H369"]},{"w":"בְּקִרְבּֽוֹ","s":["H7130"]},{"w":"׃"}]}},{"s":20,"t":{"zh_unv":"惟耶和華在他的聖殿中；全地的人都當在他面前肅敬靜默。","en_kjv":"But the LORD is in his holy temple: let all the earth keep silence before him.","en_web":"But Yahweh is in his holy temple. Let all the earth be silent before him!\"","es_rvr1909":"Mas Jehová está en su santo templo: calle delante de él toda la tierra.","es_rvc":"Pero el Señor está en su santo templo. ¡Que calle delante de él toda la tierra!","fr_nbs":"Mais le SEIGNEUR est dans son temple sacré. Silence devant lui, toute la terre !","ja_jp":"しかし、主はその聖なる宮にいます、全地はそのみ前に沈黙せよ。","ko_kor":"오직 여호와는 그 성전에 계시니 온 천하는 그 앞에서 잠잠할지니라 !","vi_vie":"Nhưng Đức Giê-hô-va ở trong đền thánh của Ngài, trước mặt Ngài, cả đất hãy làm thinh!","he_wlc":"וַֽיהוָ֖ה בְּהֵיכַ֣ל קָדְשׁ֑וֹ הַ֥ס מִפָּנָ֖יו כָּל ־ הָאָֽרֶץ ׃ פ"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"惟耶和華","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"在他的聖","s":["H6944"]},{"w":"殿","s":["H9002","H1964"]},{"w":"中；全","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"地","s":["H776"]},{"w":"的人都當在他面前","s":["H4480","H6440"]},{"w":"肅敬靜默","s":["H2013"],"m":["8761"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"But the LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"is in his holy","s":["H6944"],"i":1},{"w":"temple","s":["H1964"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"let all the earth","s":["H776"]},{"w":"keep silence","s":["H2013"],"m":["8761"]},{"w":"before","s":["H6440"]},{"w":"him."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"וַֽיהוָ֖ה","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"בְּהֵיכַ֣ל","s":["H1964"]},{"w":"קָדְשׁ֑וֹ","s":["H6944"]},{"w":"הַ֥ס","s":["H2013"]},{"w":"מִפָּנָ֖יו","s":["H6440"]},{"w":"כָּל","s":["H3605"]},{"w":"־ הָאָֽרֶץ","s":["H776"]},{"w":"׃ פ"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["let...: Heb. be silent all the earth before him"]},"p":1}]},{"c":3,"v":[{"s":1,"t":{"zh_unv":"先知哈巴谷的禱告，調用流離歌。","en_kjv":"A prayer of Habakkuk the prophet upon Shigionoth.","en_web":"A prayer of Habakkuk, the prophet, set to victorious music.","es_rvr1909":"ORACIÓN de Habacuc profeta, sobre Sigionoth.","es_rvc":"Oración del profeta Habacuc. Sobre Sigionot.","fr_nbs":"Prière d’Habacuc, le prophète, sur le mode des complaintes.","ja_jp":"シギヨノテの調べによる、預言者ハバククの祈。","ko_kor":"시기오놋에 맞춘바 선지자 하박국의 기도라","vi_vie":"Lời cầu nguyện của đấng tiên tri Ha-ba-cúc, về thể thi ca.","he_wlc":"תְּפִלָּ֖ה לַחֲבַקּ֣וּק הַנָּבִ֑יא עַ֖ל שִׁגְיֹנֽוֹת ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"先知","s":["H5030"]},{"w":"哈巴谷的","s":["H9001","H2265"]},{"w":"禱告","s":["H8605"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"調用","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"流離歌","s":["H7692"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"A prayer","s":["H8605"]},{"w":"of Habakkuk","s":["H2265"]},{"w":"the prophet","s":["H5030"]},{"w":"upon Shigionoth","s":["H7692"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"תְּפִלָּ֖ה","s":["H8605"]},{"w":"לַחֲבַקּ֣וּק","s":["H2265"]},{"w":"הַנָּבִ֑יא","s":["H5030"]},{"w":"עַ֖ל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"שִׁגְיֹנֽוֹת","s":["H7692"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["upon...: or, according to variable songs, or, tunes, called in Hebrew, Shigionoth"]}},{"s":2,"t":{"zh_unv":"耶和華啊，我聽見你的名聲（或譯：言語）就懼怕。耶和華啊，求你在這些年間復興你的作為，在這些年間顯明出來；在發怒的時候以憐憫為念。","en_kjv":"O LORD, I have heard thy speech, and was afraid: O LORD, revive thy work in the midst of the years, in the midst of the years make known; in wrath remember mercy.","en_web":"Yahweh, I have heard of your fame. I stand in awe of your deeds, Yahweh. Renew your work in the midst of the years. In the midst of the years make it known. In wrath, you remember mercy.","es_rvr1909":"Oh Jehová, oído he tu palabra, y temí: oh Jehová, aviva tu obra en medio de los tiempos, en medio de los tiempos hazla conocer; en la ira acuérdate de la misericordia.","es_rvc":"Señor, he oído hablar de tus hechos, y saberlo me llena de temor. Vuelve a actuar, Señor, en estos tiempos; date a conocer en nuestros días, y si te enojas, recuerda que eres compasivo.","fr_nbs":"SEIGNEUR, j’ai entendu parler de toi : j’ai craint ton action, SEIGNEUR. Dans le cours des années, réalise-la ; dans le cours des années, fais-la connaître ! Mais, dans ta colère, souviens-toi de ta compassion !","ja_jp":"主よ、わたしはあなたのことを聞きました。主よ、わたしはあなたのみわざを見て恐れます。この年のうちにこれを新たにし、この年のうちにこれを知らせてください。怒る時にもあわれみを思いおこしてください。","ko_kor":"여호와여 ! 내가 주께 대한 소문을 듣고 놀랐나이다 여호와여 ! 주는 주의 일을 이 수년 내에 부흥케 하옵소서 ! 이 수년 내에 나타내시옵소서 ! 진노 중에라도 긍휼을 잊지 마옵소서 !","vi_vie":"Hỡi Đức Giê-hô-va! Tôi đã nghe danh tiếng Ngài thì tôi sợ hãi. Hỡi Đức Giê-hô-va! xin Ngài lại khiến công việc Ngài dấy lên giữa các năm, Tỏ ra cho biết giữa các năm; Khi Ngài đương giận, xin hãy nhớ lại sự thương xót!","he_wlc":"יְהוָ֗ה שָׁמַ֣עְתִּי שִׁמְעֲךָ֮ יָרֵאתִי֒ יְהוָ֗ה פָּֽעָלְךָ֙ בְּקֶ֤רֶב שָׁנִים֙ חַיֵּ֔יהוּ בְּקֶ֥רֶב שָׁנִ֖ים תּוֹדִ֑יעַ בְּרֹ֖גֶז רַחֵ֥ם תִּזְכּֽוֹר ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"耶和華","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"啊，我聽見","s":["H8085"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"你的名聲（或譯：言語","s":["H8088"]},{"w":"）"},{"w":"就懼怕","s":["H3372"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"。"},{"w":"耶和華","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"啊，求你在這些年","s":["H8141"]},{"w":"間","s":["H9002","H7130"]},{"w":"復興","s":["H2421"],"m":["8761"]},{"w":"你的作為","s":["H6467"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"在這些年","s":["H8141"]},{"w":"間","s":["H9002","H7130"]},{"w":"顯明","s":["H3045"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"出來；在發怒","s":["H9002","H7267"]},{"w":"的時候以憐憫","s":["H7355"],"m":["8763"]},{"w":"為念","s":["H2142"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"O LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"w":","},{"w":"I have heard","s":["H8085"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"thy speech","s":["H8088"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and was afraid","s":["H3372"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"O LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"w":","},{"w":"revive","s":["H2421"],"m":["8761"]},{"w":"thy work","s":["H6467"]},{"w":"in the midst","s":["H7130"]},{"w":"of the years","s":["H8141"]},{"w":","},{"w":"in the midst","s":["H7130"]},{"w":"of the years","s":["H8141"]},{"w":"make known","s":["H3045"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":";"},{"w":"in wrath","s":["H7267"]},{"w":"remember","s":["H2142"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"mercy","s":["H7355"],"m":["8763"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"יְהוָ֗ה","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"שָׁמַ֣עְתִּי","s":["H8085"]},{"w":"שִׁמְעֲךָ֮","s":["H8088"]},{"w":"יָרֵאתִי֒","s":["H3372"]},{"w":"יְהוָ֗ה","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"פָּֽעָלְךָ֙","s":["H6467"]},{"w":"בְּקֶ֤רֶב","s":["H7130"]},{"w":"שָׁנִים֙","s":["H8141"]},{"w":"חַיֵּ֔יהוּ","s":["H2421"]},{"w":"בְּקֶ֥רֶב","s":["H7130"]},{"w":"שָׁנִ֖ים","s":["H8141"]},{"w":"תּוֹדִ֑יעַ","s":["H3045"]},{"w":"בְּרֹ֖גֶז","s":["H7267"]},{"w":"רַחֵ֥ם","s":["H7355"]},{"w":"תִּזְכּֽוֹר","s":["H2142"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["speech: Heb. report, or, hearing","revive: or, preserve alive"]},"p":1},{"s":3,"t":{"zh_unv":"神從提幔而來；聖者從巴蘭山臨到。（細拉）他的榮光遮蔽諸天；頌讚充滿大地。","en_kjv":"God came from Teman, and the Holy One from mount Paran. Selah. His glory covered the heavens, and the earth was full of his praise.","en_web":"God came from Teman, The Holy One from Mount Paran. Selah. His glory covered the heavens, And his praise filled the earth.","es_rvr1909":"Dios vendrá de Temán, y el Santo del monte de Parán. (Selah.) Su gloria cubrió los cielos, y la tierra se llenó de su alabanza.","es_rvc":"¡Dios viene de Temán! ¡El Santo viene del monte de Parán! ¡Su gloria cubre los cielos! ¡La tierra se llena con su alabanza!","fr_nbs":"Dieu vient de Témân, le Saint vient du mont Parân. Pause. Son éclat couvre le ciel, sa louange remplit la terre.","ja_jp":"神はテマンからこられ、聖者はパランの山からこられた。その栄光は天をおおい、そのさんびは地に満ちた。〔セラ","ko_kor":"하나님이 데만에서부터 오시며 거룩한 자가 바란 산에서부터 오시도다 (셀라) 그 영광이 하늘을 덮었고 그 찬송이 세계에 가득하도다","vi_vie":"Đức Chúa Trời đến từ Thê-man, Đấng Thánh đến từ núi Pha-ran. Vinh hiển Ngài bao phủ các từng trời, Đất đầy sự khen ngợi Ngài.","he_wlc":"אֱל֨וֹהַ֙ מִתֵּימָ֣ן יָב֔וֹא וְקָד֥וֹשׁ מֵֽהַר ־ פָּארָ֖ן סֶ֑לָה כִּסָּ֤ה שָׁמַ֨יִם֙ הוֹד֔וֹ וּתְהִלָּת֖וֹ מָלְאָ֥ה הָאָֽרֶץ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"神","s":["H433"]},{"w":"從提幔","s":["H4480","H8487"]},{"w":"而來","s":["H935"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"聖者","s":["H6918"]},{"w":"從巴蘭","s":["H6290"]},{"w":"山","s":["H4480","H2022"]},{"w":"臨到。（細拉","s":["H5542"]},{"w":"）"},{"w":"他的榮光","s":["H1935"]},{"w":"遮蔽","s":["H3680"],"m":["8765"]},{"w":"諸天","s":["H8064"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"頌讚","s":["H8416"]},{"w":"充滿","s":["H4390"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"大地","s":["H776"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"God","s":["H433"]},{"w":"came","s":["H935"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"from Teman","s":["H8487"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and the Holy One","s":["H6918"]},{"w":"from mount","s":["H2022"]},{"w":"Paran","s":["H6290"]},{"w":"."},{"w":"Selah","s":["H5542"]},{"w":"."},{"w":"His glory","s":["H1935"]},{"w":"covered","s":["H3680"],"m":["8765"]},{"w":"the heavens","s":["H8064"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and the earth","s":["H776"]},{"w":"was full","s":["H4390"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"of his praise","s":["H8416"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"אֱל֨וֹהַ֙","s":["H433"]},{"w":"מִתֵּימָ֣ן","s":["H8487"]},{"w":"יָב֔וֹא","s":["H935"]},{"w":"וְקָד֥וֹשׁ","s":["H6918"]},{"w":"מֵֽהַר","s":["H2022"]},{"w":"־ פָּארָ֖ן","s":["H6290"]},{"w":"סֶ֑לָה","s":["H5542"]},{"w":"כִּסָּ֤ה","s":["H3680"]},{"w":"שָׁמַ֨יִם֙","s":["H8064"]},{"w":"הוֹד֔וֹ","s":["H1935"]},{"w":"וּתְהִלָּת֖וֹ","s":["H8416"]},{"w":"מָלְאָ֥ה","s":["H4390"]},{"w":"הָאָֽרֶץ","s":["H776"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["Teman: or, the south"]}},{"s":4,"t":{"zh_unv":"他的輝煌如同日光；從他手裡射出光線，在其中藏著他的能力。","en_kjv":"And his brightness was as the light; he had horns coming out of his hand: and there was the hiding of his power.","en_web":"His splendor is like the sunrise. Rays shine from his hand, where his power is hidden.","es_rvr1909":"Y el resplandor fué como la luz; rayos brillantes salían de su mano; y allí estaba escondida su fortaleza.","es_rvc":"¡Su resplandor es como la luz! ¡Brillantes rayos salen de su mano! ¡Allí está escondido su poder!","fr_nbs":"C’est comme la clarté de la lumière ; des rayons partent de sa main ; la voilà, sa force cachée !","ja_jp":"その輝きは光のようであり、その光は彼の手からほとばしる。かしこにその力を隠す。","ko_kor":"그 광명이 햇빛 같고 광선이 그 손에서 나오니 그 권능이 그 속에 감취었도다","vi_vie":"Sự chói rạng của Ngài như ánh sáng, Những tia sáng ra từ Ngài, Quyền năng Ngài giấu trong nơi đó.","he_wlc":"וְנֹ֨גַהּ֙ כָּא֣וֹר תִּֽהְיֶ֔ה קַרְנַ֥יִם מִיָּד֖וֹ ל֑וֹ וְשָׁ֖ם חֶבְי֥וֹן עֻזֹּֽה ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"他的輝煌","s":["H5051","H1961"]},{"w":"如同日光","s":["H9003","H216"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"從他手","s":["H4480","H3027"]},{"w":"裡","s":["H9001"]},{"w":"射出光線","s":["H7161"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"在其中","s":["H8033"]},{"w":"藏著","s":["H2253"]},{"w":"他的能力","s":["H5797"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"And his brightness","s":["H5051"]},{"w":"was as the light","s":["H216"]},{"w":";"},{"w":"he had horns","s":["H7161"]},{"w":"coming out of his hand","s":["H3027"],"i":1},{"w":":"},{"w":"and there was the hiding","s":["H2253"]},{"w":"of his power","s":["H5797"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"וְנֹ֨גַהּ֙","s":["H5051"]},{"w":"כָּא֣וֹר","s":["H216"]},{"w":"תִּֽהְיֶ֔ה","s":["H1961"]},{"w":"קַרְנַ֥יִם","s":["H7161"]},{"w":"מִיָּד֖וֹ","s":["H3027"]},{"w":"ל֑וֹ וְשָׁ֖ם","s":["H8033"]},{"w":"חֶבְי֥וֹן","s":["H2253"]},{"w":"עֻזֹּֽה","s":["H5797"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["horns...: or, bright beams out of his side"]}},{"s":5,"t":{"zh_unv":"在他前面有瘟疫流行；在他腳下有熱症發出。","en_kjv":"Before him went the pestilence, and burning coals went forth at his feet.","en_web":"Plague went before him, And pestilence followed his feet.","es_rvr1909":"Delante de su rostro iba mortandad, y á sus pies salían carbones encendidos.","es_rvc":"Avanza precedido de gran mortandad, y cierra su marcha ardiente fuego.","fr_nbs":"Devant lui marche la peste, la fièvre sort sur ses pas.","ja_jp":"疫病はその前に行き、熱病はその後に従う。","ko_kor":"온역이 그 앞에서 행하며 불덩이가 그 발밑에서 나오도다","vi_vie":"Oân dịch đi trước mặt Ngài, Tên lửa ra nơi chơn Ngài.","he_wlc":"לְפָנָ֖יו יֵ֣לֶךְ דָּ֑בֶר וְיֵצֵ֥א רֶ֖שֶׁף לְרַגְלָֽיו ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"在他前面","s":["H9001","H6440"]},{"w":"有瘟疫","s":["H1698"]},{"w":"流行","s":["H3212"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"在他腳","s":["H9001","H7272"]},{"w":"下有熱症","s":["H7565"]},{"w":"發出","s":["H3318"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Before","s":["H6440"]},{"w":"him went","s":["H3212"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"the pestilence","s":["H1698"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and burning coals","s":["H7565"]},{"w":"went forth","s":["H3318"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"at his feet","s":["H7272"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"לְפָנָ֖יו","s":["H6440"]},{"w":"יֵ֣לֶךְ","s":["H3212"]},{"w":"דָּ֑בֶר","s":["H1698"]},{"w":"וְיֵצֵ֥א","s":["H3318"]},{"w":"רֶ֖שֶׁף","s":["H7565"]},{"w":"לְרַגְלָֽיו","s":["H7272"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["coals: or, diseases"]}},{"s":6,"t":{"zh_unv":"他站立，量了大地（或譯：使地震動），觀看，趕散萬民。永久的山崩裂；長存的嶺塌陷；他的作為與古時一樣。","en_kjv":"He stood, and measured the earth: he beheld, and drove asunder the nations; and the everlasting mountains were scattered, the perpetual hills did bow: his ways are everlasting.","en_web":"He stood, and shook the earth. He looked, and made the nations tremble. The ancient mountains were crumbled. The age-old hills collapsed. His ways are eternal.","es_rvr1909":"Paróse, y midió la tierra: miró, é hizo temblar las gentes; y los montes antiguos fueron desmenuzados, los collados antiguos se humillaron á él. Sus caminos son eternos.","es_rvc":"Si se detiene, la tierra se estremece; si lanza una mirada, tiemblan las naciones, las montañas eternas se desmoronan, y las colinas perennes se hunden. ¡Sus caminos son eternos!","fr_nbs":"Il se dresse et prend la mesure de la terre, il regarde et fait sursauter les nations. Les montagnes d’antan se disloquent ; devant lui s’effondrent les collines d’autrefois, les sentiers d’autrefois.","ja_jp":"彼は立って、地をはかり、彼は見て、諸国民をおののかせられる。とこしえの山は散らされ、永遠の丘は沈む。彼の道は昔のとおりである。","ko_kor":"그가 서신즉 땅이 진동하며 그가 보신즉 열국이 전률하며 영원한 산이 무너지며 무궁한 작은 산이 엎드러지나니 그 행하심이 예로부터 그러하시도다","vi_vie":"Ngài đứng và đo đất; Ngài nhìn xem, làm tan tác các dân tộc; Các núi hằng còn đều tan nát, Các đồi đời đời đều quì xuống: Các đường lối Ngài giống như thuở xưa.","he_wlc":"עָמַ֣ד ׀ וַיְמֹ֣דֶד אֶ֗רֶץ רָאָה֙ וַיַּתֵּ֣ר גּוֹיִ֔ם וַיִּתְפֹּֽצְצוּ֙ הַרְרֵי ־ עַ֔ד שַׁח֖וּ גִּבְע֣וֹת עוֹלָ֑ם הֲלִיכ֥וֹת עוֹלָ֖ם לֽוֹ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"他站立","s":["H5975"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"量了","s":["H4058"],"m":["8787"]},{"w":"大地","s":["H776"]},{"w":"（或譯：使地震動）"},{"w":"，"},{"w":"觀看","s":["H7200"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"趕散","s":["H5425"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"萬民","s":["H1471"]},{"w":"。"},{"w":"永久","s":["H5703"]},{"w":"的山","s":["H2042"]},{"w":"崩裂","s":["H6327"],"m":["8691"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"長存","s":["H5769"]},{"w":"的嶺","s":["H1389"]},{"w":"塌陷","s":["H7817"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"他的","s":["H9001"]},{"w":"作為","s":["H1979"]},{"w":"與古時","s":["H5769"]},{"w":"一樣。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"He stood","s":["H5975"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and measured","s":["H4128"],"m":["8787"]},{"w":"the earth","s":["H776"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"he beheld","s":["H7200"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and drove asunder","s":["H5425"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"the nations","s":["H1471"]},{"w":";"},{"w":"and the everlasting","s":["H5703"]},{"w":"mountains","s":["H2042"]},{"w":"were scattered","s":["H6327"],"m":["8691"]},{"w":","},{"w":"the perpetual","s":["H5769"]},{"w":"hills","s":["H1389"]},{"w":"did bow","s":["H7817"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"his ways","s":["H1979"]},{"w":"are everlasting","s":["H5769"],"i":1},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"עָמַ֣ד","s":["H5975"]},{"w":"׀ וַיְמֹ֣דֶד","s":["H4128"]},{"w":"אֶ֗רֶץ","s":["H776"]},{"w":"רָאָה֙","s":["H7200"]},{"w":"וַיַּתֵּ֣ר","s":["H5425"]},{"w":"גּוֹיִ֔ם","s":["H1471"]},{"w":"וַיִּתְפֹּֽצְצוּ֙","s":["H6327"]},{"w":"הַרְרֵי","s":["H2042"]},{"w":"־ עַ֔ד","s":["H5703"]},{"w":"שַׁח֖וּ","s":["H7817"]},{"w":"גִּבְע֣וֹת","s":["H1389"]},{"w":"עוֹלָ֑ם","s":["H5769"]},{"w":"הֲלִיכ֥וֹת","s":["H1979"]},{"w":"עוֹלָ֖ם","s":["H5769"]},{"w":"לֽוֹ ׃"}]}},{"s":7,"t":{"zh_unv":"我見古珊的帳棚遭難，米甸的幔子戰兢。","en_kjv":"I saw the tents of Cushan in affliction: and the curtains of the land of Midian did tremble.","en_web":"I saw the tents of Cushan in affliction. The dwellings of the land of Midian trembled.","es_rvr1909":"He visto las tiendas de Cushán en aflicción; las tiendas de la tierra de Madián temblaron.","es_rvc":"He visto aflicción en las tiendas de Cusán, y angustia en las tiendas de Madián.","fr_nbs":"Je vois les tentes de Koushân réduites à rien, les toiles du pays de Madiân frémissent.","ja_jp":"わたしが見ると、クシャンの天幕に悩みがあり、ミデアンの国の幕は震う。","ko_kor":"내가 본즉 구산의 장막이 환난을 당하고 미디안 땅의 휘장이 흔들리도다","vi_vie":"Ta thấy những trại của Cu-san bị hoạn nạn, Những màn cháng của đất Ma-đi-an lung lay.","he_wlc":"תַּ֣חַת אָ֔וֶן רָאִ֖יתִי אָהֳלֵ֣י כוּשָׁ֑ן יִרְגְּז֕וּן יְרִיע֖וֹת אֶ֥רֶץ מִדְיָֽן ׃ ס"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"我見","s":["H7200"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"古珊","s":["H3572"]},{"w":"的帳棚","s":["H168"]},{"w":"遭","s":["H8478"]},{"w":"難","s":["H205"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"米甸","s":["H4080","H776"]},{"w":"的幔子","s":["H3407"]},{"w":"戰兢","s":["H7264"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"I saw","s":["H7200"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"the tents","s":["H168"]},{"w":"of Cushan","s":["H3572"]},{"w":"in affliction","s":["H205"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"and the curtains","s":["H3407"]},{"w":"of the land","s":["H776"]},{"w":"of Midian","s":["H4080"]},{"w":"did tremble","s":["H7264"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"תַּ֣חַת","s":["H8478"]},{"w":"אָ֔וֶן","s":["H205"]},{"w":"רָאִ֖יתִי","s":["H7200"]},{"w":"אָהֳלֵ֣י","s":["H168"]},{"w":"כוּשָׁ֑ן","s":["H3572"]},{"w":"יִרְגְּז֕וּן","s":["H7264"]},{"w":"יְרִיע֖וֹת","s":["H3407"]},{"w":"אֶ֥רֶץ","s":["H776"]},{"w":"מִדְיָֽן","s":["H4080"]},{"w":"׃ ס"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["Cushan: or, Ethiopia","in...: or, under affliction, or, vanity"]}},{"s":8,"t":{"zh_unv":"耶和華啊，你乘在馬上，坐在得勝的車上，豈是不喜悅江河、向江河發怒氣、向洋海發憤恨嗎？","en_kjv":"Was the LORD displeased against the rivers? was thine anger against the rivers? was thy wrath against the sea, that thou didst ride upon thine horses and thy chariots of salvation?","en_web":"Was Yahweh displeased with the rivers? Was your anger against the rivers, Or your wrath against the sea, That you rode on your horses, On your chariots of salvation?","es_rvr1909":"¿Airóse Jehová contra los ríos? ¿contra los ríos fué tu enojo? ¿tu ira contra la mar, cuando subiste sobre tus caballos, y sobre tus carros de salud?","es_rvc":"¿Te enojaste, Señor, contra los ríos? ¿Te airaste contra ellos? ¿Se desató tu furia contra el mar cuando montaste en tus caballos y subiste en tus carros de victoria?","fr_nbs":"Est-ce contre les fleuves que le SEIGNEUR est fâché ? Ta colère est-elle contre les fleuves, ta fureur contre la mer, lorsque tu montes sur tes chevaux, sur tes chars de victoire ?","ja_jp":"主よ、あなたが馬に乗り、勝利の戦車に乗られる時、あなたは川に向かって怒られるのか。川に向かって憤られるのか。あるいは海に向かって立腹されるのか。","ko_kor":"여호와여 ! 주께서 말을 타시며 구원의 병거를 모시오니 하수를 분히 여기심이니이까 ? 강을 노여워 하심이니이까 ? 바다를 대하여 성 내심이니이까 ?","vi_vie":"Có phải Đức Giê-hô-va nổi giận nghịch cùng các sông chăng? Cơn giận Ngài có phải nổi lên nghịch cùng các sông chăng? Có phải sự thạnh nộ Ngài nổi lên nghịch cũng biển, Khi Ngài cỡi ngựa cỡi xe đặng giải cứu chăng?","he_wlc":"הֲבִנְהָרִים֙ חָרָ֣ה יְהוָ֔ה אִ֤ם בַּנְּהָרִים֙ אַפֶּ֔ךָ אִם ־ בַּיָּ֖ם עֶבְרָתֶ֑ךָ כִּ֤י תִרְכַּב֙ עַל ־ סוּסֶ֔יךָ מַרְכְּבֹתֶ֖יךָ יְשׁוּעָֽה ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"耶和華","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"啊，","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"你乘","s":["H7392"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"在","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"馬","s":["H5483"]},{"w":"上，坐在得勝","s":["H3444"]},{"w":"的車","s":["H4818"]},{"w":"上，豈是","s":["H518"]},{"w":"不喜悅","s":["H2734"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"江河","s":["H9002","H5104"]},{"w":"、"},{"w":"向江河","s":["H9002","H5104"]},{"w":"發怒氣","s":["H639"]},{"w":"、","s":["H518"]},{"w":"向洋海","s":["H9002","H3220"]},{"w":"發憤恨","s":["H5678"]},{"w":"嗎？"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Was the LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"displeased","s":["H2734"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"against the rivers","s":["H5104"]},{"w":"?"},{"w":"was thine anger","s":["H639"]},{"w":"against the rivers","s":["H5104"]},{"w":"?"},{"w":"was thy wrath","s":["H5678"]},{"w":"against the sea","s":["H3220"]},{"w":","},{"w":"that thou didst ride","s":["H7392"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"upon thine horses","s":["H5483"]},{"w":"and thy chariots","s":["H4818"],"i":1},{"w":"of salvation","s":["H3444"]},{"w":"?"}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"הֲבִנְהָרִים֙","s":["H5104"]},{"w":"חָרָ֣ה","s":["H2734"]},{"w":"יְהוָ֔ה","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"אִ֤ם","s":["H518"]},{"w":"בַּנְּהָרִים֙","s":["H5104"]},{"w":"אַפֶּ֔ךָ","s":["H639"]},{"w":"אִם","s":["H518"]},{"w":"־ בַּיָּ֖ם","s":["H3220"]},{"w":"עֶבְרָתֶ֑ךָ","s":["H5678"]},{"w":"כִּ֤י","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"תִרְכַּב֙","s":["H7392"]},{"w":"עַל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"־ סוּסֶ֔יךָ","s":["H5483"]},{"w":"מַרְכְּבֹתֶ֖יךָ","s":["H4818"]},{"w":"יְשׁוּעָֽה","s":["H3444"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["of...: or, were salvation?"]}},{"s":9,"t":{"zh_unv":"你的弓全然顯露，向眾支派所起的誓都是可信的。（細拉）你以江河分開大地。","en_kjv":"Thy bow was made quite naked, according to the oaths of the tribes, even thy word. Selah. Thou didst cleave the earth with rivers.","en_web":"You uncovered your bow. You called for your sworn arrows. Selah. You split the earth with rivers.","es_rvr1909":"Descubrióse enteramente tu arco, los juramentos á las tribus, palabra segura. (Selah.) Hendiste la tierra con ríos.","es_rvc":"Al quedar tu arco al descubierto, pudo verse tu aljaba repleta de flechas. Con los ríos divides la tierra.","fr_nbs":"Ton arc est mis à nu, tes serments sont les flèches de ta parole. Pause. Tu fends la terre par des fleuves.","ja_jp":"あなたの弓は取り出された。矢は、弦につがえられた。〔セラあなたは川をもって地を裂かれた。","ko_kor":"주께서 활을 꺼내시고 살을 바로 발하셨나이다 (셀라) 주께서 하수들로 땅을 쪼개셨나이다","vi_vie":"Cung Ngài ra khỏi bao; Lời thề cũng các chi phái là lời chắc chắn. Ngài phân rẽ đất làm cho sông chảy ra.","he_wlc":"עֶרְיָ֤ה תֵעוֹר֙ קַשְׁתֶּ֔ךָ שְׁבֻע֥וֹת מַטּ֖וֹת אֹ֣מֶר סֶ֑לָה נְהָר֖וֹת תְּבַקַּע ־ אָֽרֶץ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"你的弓","s":["H7198"]},{"w":"全然顯露","s":["H6181","H5783"],"m":["8735"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"向眾支派","s":["H4294"]},{"w":"所起的誓","s":["H7621","H562"]},{"w":"都是可信的。（細拉","s":["H5542"]},{"w":"）"},{"w":"你以江河","s":["H5104"]},{"w":"分開","s":["H1234"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"大地","s":["H776"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Thy bow","s":["H7198"]},{"w":"was made quite","s":["H6181"]},{"w":"naked","s":["H5783"],"m":["8735"]},{"w":","},{"w":"according to the oaths","s":["H7621"]},{"w":"of the tribes","s":["H4294"]},{"w":","},{"w":"even thy word","s":["H562"]},{"w":"."},{"w":"Selah","s":["H5542"]},{"w":"."},{"w":"Thou didst cleave","s":["H1234"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"the earth","s":["H776"]},{"w":"with rivers","s":["H5104"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"עֶרְיָ֤ה","s":["H6181"]},{"w":"תֵעוֹר֙","s":["H5783"]},{"w":"קַשְׁתֶּ֔ךָ","s":["H7198"]},{"w":"שְׁבֻע֥וֹת","s":["H7621"]},{"w":"מַטּ֖וֹת","s":["H4294"]},{"w":"אֹ֣מֶר","s":["H562"]},{"w":"סֶ֑לָה","s":["H5542"]},{"w":"נְהָר֖וֹת","s":["H5104"]},{"w":"תְּבַקַּע","s":["H1234"]},{"w":"־ אָֽרֶץ","s":["H776"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["earth...: or, rivers of the earth"]}},{"s":10,"t":{"zh_unv":"山嶺見你，無不戰懼；大水氾濫過去，深淵發聲，洶湧翻騰（原文是向上舉手）。","en_kjv":"The mountains saw thee, and they trembled: the overflowing of the water passed by: the deep uttered his voice, and lifted up his hands on high.","en_web":"The mountains saw you, and were afraid. The tempest of waters passed by. The deep roared and lifted up its hands on high.","es_rvr1909":"Viéronte, y tuvieron temor los montes: pasó la inundación de las aguas: el abismo dió su voz, la hondura alzó sus manos.","es_rvc":"Los montes te ven, y tiemblan. Pasan las aguas y todo lo inundan; el mar profundo deja oír su voz, y las grandes olas se agitan.","fr_nbs":"Les montagnes te voient et tremblent, une averse violente passe, l’abîme fait entendre sa voix, il lève ses mains en haut.","ja_jp":"山々はあなたを見て震い、荒れ狂う水は流れいで、淵は声を出して、その手を高くあげた。","ko_kor":"산들이 주를 보고 흔들리며 창수가 넘치고 바다가 소리를 지르며 손을 높이 들었나이다","vi_vie":"Các núi thấy Ngài thì đều sợ hãi; Các dòng nước chảy mạnh, Vực sâu vang tiếng, Rún biển giơ tay lên cao.","he_wlc":"רָא֤וּךָ יָחִ֨ילוּ֙ הָרִ֔ים זֶ֥רֶם מַ֖יִם עָבָ֑ר נָתַ֤ן תְּהוֹם֙ קוֹל֔וֹ ר֖וֹם יָדֵ֥יהוּ נָשָֽׂא ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"山嶺","s":["H2022"]},{"w":"見你","s":["H7200"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"無不戰懼","s":["H2342"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"大水","s":["H4325"]},{"w":"氾濫","s":["H2230"]},{"w":"過去","s":["H5674"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"深淵","s":["H8415"]},{"w":"發","s":["H5414"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"聲","s":["H6963"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"洶湧翻騰（原文是向上","s":["H7315"]},{"w":"舉","s":["H5375"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"手","s":["H3027"]},{"w":"）。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"The mountains","s":["H2022"]},{"w":"saw","s":["H7200"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"thee, and they trembled","s":["H2342"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"the overflowing","s":["H2230"]},{"w":"of the water","s":["H4325"]},{"w":"passed by","s":["H5674"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"the deep","s":["H8415"]},{"w":"uttered","s":["H5414"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"his voice","s":["H6963"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and lifted up","s":["H5375"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"his hands","s":["H3027"]},{"w":"on high","s":["H7315"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"רָא֤וּךָ","s":["H7200"]},{"w":"יָחִ֨ילוּ֙","s":["H2342"]},{"w":"הָרִ֔ים","s":["H2022"]},{"w":"זֶ֥רֶם","s":["H2230"]},{"w":"מַ֖יִם","s":["H4325"]},{"w":"עָבָ֑ר","s":["H5674"]},{"w":"נָתַ֤ן","s":["H5414"]},{"w":"תְּהוֹם֙","s":["H8415"]},{"w":"קוֹל֔וֹ","s":["H6963"]},{"w":"ר֖וֹם","s":["H7315"]},{"w":"יָדֵ֥יהוּ","s":["H3027"]},{"w":"נָשָֽׂא","s":["H5375"]},{"w":"׃"}]}},{"s":11,"t":{"zh_unv":"因你的箭射出發光，你的槍閃出光耀，日月都在本宮停住。","en_kjv":"The sun and moon stood still in their habitation: at the light of thine arrows they went, and at the shining of thy glittering spear.","en_web":"The sun and moon stood still in the sky, At the light of your arrows as they went, At the shining of your glittering spear.","es_rvr1909":"El sol y la luna se pararon en su estancia: á la luz de tus saetas anduvieron, y al resplandor de tu fulgente lanza.","es_rvc":"Al ver el resplandor de tus saetas, y el brillo de tu deslumbrante lanza, el sol y la luna detienen su marcha.","fr_nbs":"Le soleil — la lune s’arrête dans sa résidence à la lumière de tes flèches qui partent, à la clarté fulgurante de ta lance.","ja_jp":"飛び行くあなたの矢の光のために、電光のようにきらめく、あなたのやりのために、日も月もそのすみかに立ち止まった。","ko_kor":"주의 날으는 살의 빛과 주의 번쩍이는 창의 광채로 인하여 해와 달이 그 처소에 멈추었나이다","vi_vie":"Mặt trời mặt trăng dừng lại trong nơi ở nó; Vì cớ bóng sáng của những tên Ngài, Và chớp nháng của gươm giáo Ngài chiếu ra.","he_wlc":"שֶׁ֥מֶשׁ יָרֵ֖חַ עָ֣מַד זְבֻ֑לָה לְא֤וֹר חִצֶּ֨יךָ֙ יְהַלֵּ֔כוּ לְנֹ֖גַהּ בְּרַ֥ק חֲנִיתֶֽךָ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"因你的箭","s":["H2671"]},{"w":"射出","s":["H1980"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":"發光","s":["H9001","H216"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"你的槍","s":["H2595"]},{"w":"閃出","s":["H1300"]},{"w":"光耀","s":["H9001","H5051"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"日","s":["H8121"]},{"w":"月","s":["H3394"]},{"w":"都在本宮","s":["H2073"]},{"w":"停住","s":["H5975"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"The sun","s":["H8121"]},{"w":"and moon","s":["H3394"],"i":1},{"w":"stood still","s":["H5975"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"in their habitation","s":["H2073"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"at the light","s":["H216"]},{"w":"of thine arrows","s":["H2671"]},{"w":"they went","s":["H1980"],"m":["8762"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and at the shining","s":["H5051"]},{"w":"of thy glittering","s":["H1300"]},{"w":"spear","s":["H2595"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"שֶׁ֥מֶשׁ","s":["H8121"]},{"w":"יָרֵ֖חַ","s":["H3394"]},{"w":"עָ֣מַד","s":["H5975"]},{"w":"זְבֻ֑לָה","s":["H2073"]},{"w":"לְא֤וֹר","s":["H216"]},{"w":"חִצֶּ֨יךָ֙","s":["H2671"]},{"w":"יְהַלֵּ֔כוּ","s":["H1980"]},{"w":"לְנֹ֖גַהּ","s":["H5051"]},{"w":"בְּרַ֥ק","s":["H1300"]},{"w":"חֲנִיתֶֽךָ","s":["H2595"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["at the light...: or, thine arrows walked in the light"]}},{"s":12,"t":{"zh_unv":"你發忿恨通行大地，發怒氣責打列國，如同打糧。","en_kjv":"Thou didst march through the land in indignation, thou didst thresh the heathen in anger.","en_web":"You marched through the land in wrath. You threshed the nations in anger.","es_rvr1909":"Con ira hollaste la tierra, con furor trillaste las gentes.","es_rvc":"En tu ira, pisoteas la tierra; en tu furor, aplastas a las naciones.","fr_nbs":"Tu parcours la terre avec fureur, tu piétines les nations avec colère.","ja_jp":"あなたは憤って地を行きめぐり、怒って諸国民を踏みつけられた。","ko_kor":"주께서 노를 발하사 땅에 돌리셨으며 분을 내사 열국을 밟으셨나이다","vi_vie":"Ngài nổi giận bước qua đất; Và đương cơn thạnh nộ giày đạp các dân tộc.","he_wlc":"בְּזַ֖עַם תִּצְעַד ־ אָ֑רֶץ בְּאַ֖ף תָּד֥וּשׁ גּוֹיִֽם ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"你發忿恨","s":["H9002","H2195"]},{"w":"通行","s":["H6805"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"大地","s":["H776"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"發怒氣","s":["H9002","H639"]},{"w":"責打列國","s":["H1471"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"如同打糧","s":["H1758"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Thou didst march through","s":["H6805"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"the land","s":["H776"]},{"w":"in indignation","s":["H2195"]},{"w":","},{"w":"thou didst thresh","s":["H1758"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"the heathen","s":["H1471"]},{"w":"in anger","s":["H639"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"בְּזַ֖עַם","s":["H2195"]},{"w":"תִּצְעַד","s":["H6805"]},{"w":"־ אָ֑רֶץ","s":["H776"]},{"w":"בְּאַ֖ף","s":["H639"]},{"w":"תָּד֥וּשׁ","s":["H1758"]},{"w":"גּוֹיִֽם","s":["H1471"]},{"w":"׃"}]}},{"s":13,"t":{"zh_unv":"你出來要拯救你的百姓，拯救你的受膏者，打破惡人家長的頭，露出他的腳（原文是根基），直到頸項。（細拉）","en_kjv":"Thou wentest forth for the salvation of thy people, even for salvation with thine anointed; thou woundedst the head out of the house of the wicked, by discovering the foundation unto the neck. Selah.","en_web":"You went forth for the salvation of your people, For the salvation of your anointed. You crushed the head of the land of wickedness. You stripped them head to foot. Selah.","es_rvr1909":"Saliste para salvar tu pueblo, para salvar con tu ungido. Traspasaste la cabeza de la casa del impío, desnudando el cimiento hasta el cuello. (Selah.)","es_rvc":"Acudes al llamado de tu pueblo, y sales en ayuda de tu ungido. Abates la casa del jefe malvado, y lo dejas desnudo de pies a cabeza.","fr_nbs":"Tu sors pour le salut de ton peuple, pour le salut de l’homme qui a reçu ton onction. Tu fracasses le faîte de la maison du méchant, tu la détruis de fond en comble. Pause.","ja_jp":"あなたはあなたの民を救うため、あなたの油そそいだ者を救うために出て行かれた。あなたは悪しき者の頭を砕き、彼を腰から首まで裸にされた。〔セラ","ko_kor":"주께서 주의 백성을 구원하시려고, 기름 받은 자를 구원하시려고 나오사 악인의 집머리를 치시며 그 기초를 끝까지 드러내셨나이다 (셀라)","vi_vie":"Ngài đi ra đặng cứu dân mình, Đi ra đặng cứu đấng chịu xức dầu của mình; Ngài đánh thương đầu kẻ ác, phá nhà nó, Làm trần trụi nền nó cho đến cổ.","he_wlc":"יָצָ֨אתָ֙ לְיֵ֣שַׁע עַמֶּ֔ךָ לְיֵ֖שַׁע אֶת ־ מְשִׁיחֶ֑ךָ מָחַ֤צְתָּ רֹּאשׁ֙ מִבֵּ֣ית רָשָׁ֔ע עָר֛וֹת יְס֥וֹד עַד ־ צַוָּ֖אר סֶֽלָה ׃ פ"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"你出來","s":["H3318"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"要拯救","s":["H9001","H3468"]},{"w":"你的百姓","s":["H5971"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"拯救","s":["H9001","H3468","H853"]},{"w":"你的受膏者","s":["H4899"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"打破","s":["H4272"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"惡人","s":["H7563"]},{"w":"家","s":["H4480","H1004"]},{"w":"長的頭","s":["H7218"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"露出","s":["H6168"],"m":["8763"]},{"w":"他的腳（原文是根基","s":["H3247"]},{"w":"），"},{"w":"直到","s":["H5704"]},{"w":"頸項","s":["H6677"]},{"w":"。"},{"w":"（細拉","s":["H5542"]},{"w":"）"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Thou wentest forth","s":["H3318"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"for the salvation","s":["H3468"]},{"w":"of thy people","s":["H5971"]},{"w":","},{"w":"even for salvation","s":["H3468"]},{"w":"with thine anointed","s":["H4899"]},{"w":";"},{"w":"thou woundedst","s":["H4272"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"the head","s":["H7218"]},{"w":"out of the house","s":["H1004"]},{"w":"of the wicked","s":["H7563"]},{"w":","},{"w":"by discovering","s":["H6168"],"m":["8763"]},{"w":"the foundation","s":["H3247"]},{"w":"unto the neck","s":["H6677"]},{"w":"."},{"w":"Selah","s":["H5542"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"יָצָ֨אתָ֙","s":["H3318"]},{"w":"לְיֵ֣שַׁע","s":["H3468"]},{"w":"עַמֶּ֔ךָ","s":["H5971"]},{"w":"לְיֵ֖שַׁע","s":["H3468"]},{"w":"אֶת","s":["H854"]},{"w":"־ מְשִׁיחֶ֑ךָ","s":["H4899"]},{"w":"מָחַ֤צְתָּ","s":["H4272"]},{"w":"רֹּאשׁ֙","s":["H7218"]},{"w":"מִבֵּ֣ית","s":["H1004"]},{"w":"רָשָׁ֔ע","s":["H7563"]},{"w":"עָר֛וֹת","s":["H6168"]},{"w":"יְס֥וֹד","s":["H3247"]},{"w":"עַד","s":["H5704"]},{"w":"־ צַוָּ֖אר","s":["H6677"]},{"w":"סֶֽלָה","s":["H5542"]},{"w":"׃ פ"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["by...: Heb. making naked"]}},{"s":14,"t":{"zh_unv":"你用敵人的戈矛刺透他戰士的頭；他們來如旋風，要將我們分散。他們所喜愛的是暗中吞吃貧民。","en_kjv":"Thou didst strike through with his staves the head of his villages: they came out as a whirlwind to scatter me: their rejoicing was as to devour the poor secretly.","en_web":"You pierced the heads of his warriors with their own spears. They came as a whirlwind to scatter me, Gloating as if to devour the wretched in secret.","es_rvr1909":"Horadaste con sus báculos las cabezas de sus villas, que como tempestad acometieron para derramarme: su orgullo era como para devorar al pobre encubiertamente.","es_rvc":"Horadas con sus propios dardos la cabeza de sus guerreros, que arremeten contra mí para que huya, y gozan devorando al pobre que se esconde.","fr_nbs":"Tu transperces de leurs propres flèches la tête de ses chefs qui se précipitent en tempête pour me mettre en pièces en poussant des cris de joie, comme s’ils dévoraient déjà le pauvre dans leur repaire.","ja_jp":"あなたはあなたのやりで将軍の首を刺しとおされた。彼らはわたしを散らそうとして、つむじ風のように来、貧しい者をひそかに、のみ滅ぼすことを楽しみとした。","ko_kor":"그들이 회리바람처럼 이르러 나를 흩으려 하며 가만히 가난한 자 삼키기를 즐거워하나 오직 주께서 그들의 전사의 머리를 그들의 창으로 찌르셨나이다","vi_vie":"Ngài lấy giáo nó đâu đầu lính chiến nó, Chúng nó đến như trận bão đặng làm tan tác tôi; Chúng nó vui thích như nuốt kẻ bần cùng cách kín giấu.","he_wlc":"נָקַ֤בְתָּ בְמַטָּיו֙ רֹ֣אשׁ פרזו יִסְעֲר֖וּ לַהֲפִיצֵ֑נִי עֲלִ֣יצֻתָ֔ם כְּמוֹ ־ לֶאֱכֹ֥ל עָנִ֖י בַּמִּסְתָּֽר ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"你用敵人的戈矛","s":["H9002","H4294"]},{"w":"刺透","s":["H5344"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"他戰士","s":["H6518"]},{"w":"的頭","s":["H7218"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"他們來如旋風","s":["H5590"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"要將我們分散","s":["H9001","H6327"],"m":["8687"]},{"w":"。"},{"w":"他們所喜愛","s":["H5951"]},{"w":"的是","s":["H3644"]},{"w":"暗中","s":["H9002","H4565"]},{"w":"吞吃","s":["H9001","H398"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"貧民","s":["H6041"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Thou didst strike through","s":["H5344"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"with his staves","s":["H4294"]},{"w":"the head","s":["H7218"]},{"w":"of his villages","s":["H6518"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"they came out as a whirlwind","s":["H5590"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"to scatter","s":["H6327"],"m":["8687"]},{"w":"me: their rejoicing","s":["H5951"]},{"w":"was as to devour","s":["H398"],"m":["8800"],"i":1},{"w":"the poor","s":["H6041"]},{"w":"secretly","s":["H4565"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"נָקַ֤בְתָּ","s":["H5344"]},{"w":"בְמַטָּיו֙","s":["H4294"]},{"w":"רֹ֣אשׁ","s":["H7218"]},{"w":"פרזו","s":["H6518"]},{"w":"יִסְעֲר֖וּ","s":["H5590"]},{"w":"לַהֲפִיצֵ֑נִי","s":["H6327"]},{"w":"עֲלִ֣יצֻתָ֔ם","s":["H5951"]},{"w":"כְּמוֹ","s":["H3644"]},{"w":"־ לֶאֱכֹ֥ל","s":["H398"]},{"w":"עָנִ֖י","s":["H6041"]},{"w":"בַּמִּסְתָּֽר","s":["H4565"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["came...: Heb. were tempestuous"]}},{"s":15,"t":{"zh_unv":"你乘馬踐踏紅海，就是踐踏洶湧的大水。","en_kjv":"Thou didst walk through the sea with thine horses, through the heap of great waters.","en_web":"You trampled the sea with your horses, Churning mighty waters.","es_rvr1909":"Hiciste camino en la mar á tus caballos, por montón de grandes aguas.","es_rvc":"Tú cabalgas en el mar con tus caballos, y haces que se agiten las muchas aguas.","fr_nbs":"Tu as ouvert un chemin à tes chevaux dans la mer, dans un bouillonnement de grandes eaux.","ja_jp":"あなたはあなたの馬を使って、海と大水のさかまくところを踏みつけられた。","ko_kor":"주께서 말을 타시고 바다 곧 큰 물의 파도를 밟으셨나이다","vi_vie":"Ngài cỡi ngựa đạp trên biển, Trong đống nước lớn.","he_wlc":"דָּרַ֥כְתָּ בַיָּ֖ם סוּסֶ֑יךָ חֹ֖מֶר מַ֥יִם רַבִּֽים ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"你乘馬","s":["H5483"]},{"w":"踐踏","s":["H1869"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"紅海","s":["H9002","H3220"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"就是踐踏洶湧","s":["H2563"]},{"w":"的大","s":["H7227"]},{"w":"水","s":["H4325"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Thou didst walk","s":["H1869"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"through the sea","s":["H3220"]},{"w":"with thine horses","s":["H5483"]},{"w":","},{"w":"through the heap","s":["H2563"]},{"w":"of great","s":["H7227"]},{"w":"waters","s":["H4325"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"דָּרַ֥כְתָּ","s":["H1869"]},{"w":"בַיָּ֖ם","s":["H3220"]},{"w":"סוּסֶ֑יךָ","s":["H5483"]},{"w":"חֹ֖מֶר","s":["H2563"]},{"w":"מַ֥יִם","s":["H4325"]},{"w":"רַבִּֽים","s":["H7227"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["heap: or, mud"]},"p":1},{"s":16,"t":{"zh_unv":"我聽見耶和華的聲音，身體戰兢，嘴唇發顫，骨中朽爛；我在所立之處戰兢。我只可安靜等候災難之日臨到，犯境之民上來。","en_kjv":"When I heard, my belly trembled; my lips quivered at the voice: rottenness entered into my bones, and I trembled in myself, that I might rest in the day of trouble: when he cometh up unto the people, he will invade them with his troops.","en_web":"I heard, and my body trembled. My lips quivered at the voice. Rottenness enters into my bones, and I tremble in my place, Because I must wait quietly for the day of trouble, For the coming up of the people who invade us.","es_rvr1909":"Oí, y tembló mi vientre; á la voz se batieron mis labios; pudrición se entró en mis huesos, y en mi asiento me estremecí; si bien estaré quieto en el día de la angustia, cuando suba al pueblo el que lo invadirá con sus tropas.","es_rvc":"Al oírte, se estremecen mis entrañas; mis labios tiemblan al escuchar tu voz. El mal me cala hasta los huesos, y en mi interior todo se estremece, pero yo espero confiado el día de la angustia, el día en que será invadido el pueblo que ahora nos oprime.","fr_nbs":"J’ai entendu, et mes entrailles ont frémi. A ce bruit mes lèvres balbutient ; mes os pourrissent, et sans bouger je frémis d’attendre le jour de la détresse où notre assaillant attaquera le peuple.","ja_jp":"わたしは聞いて、わたしのからだはわななき、わたしのくちびるはその声を聞いて震える。腐れはわたしの骨に入り、わたしの歩みは、わたしの下によろめく。わたしはわれわれに攻め寄せる民の上に悩みの日の臨むのを静かに待とう。","ko_kor":"내가 들었으므로 내 창자가 흔들렸고 그 목소리로 인하여 내 입술이 떨렸도다 무리가 우리를 치러 올라오는 환난 날을 내가 기다리므로 내 뼈에 썩이는 것이 들어 왔으며 내 몸은 내 처소에서 떨리는도다","vi_vie":"Tôi đã nghe, thì thân thể tôi run rẩy, Nghe tiếng Ngài thì môi tôi rung động; Sự mục nát nhập vào xương tôi; và tôi run rẩy trong chỗ tôi, Vì tôi phải nín lặng để chờ ngày hoạn nạn, Là ngày có dân đến xâm chiếm chúng tôi.","he_wlc":"שָׁמַ֣עְתִּי ׀ וַתִּרְגַּ֣ז בִּטְנִ֗י לְקוֹל֙ צָלֲל֣וּ שְׂפָתַ֔י יָב֥וֹא רָקָ֛ב בַּעֲצָמַ֖י וְתַחְתַּ֣י אֶרְגָּ֑ז אֲשֶׁ֤ר אָנ֨וּחַ֙ לְי֣וֹם צָרָ֔ה לַעֲל֖וֹת לְעַ֥ם יְגוּדֶֽנּוּ ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"我聽見","s":["H8085"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"耶和華的聲音","s":["H9001","H6963"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"身體","s":["H990"]},{"w":"戰兢","s":["H7264"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"嘴唇","s":["H8193"]},{"w":"發顫","s":["H6750"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"骨","s":["H9002","H6106"]},{"w":"中","s":["H935"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"朽爛","s":["H7538"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"我在所立之處","s":["H8478"]},{"w":"戰兢","s":["H7264"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"。"},{"w":"我只可","s":["H834"]},{"w":"安靜等候","s":["H5117"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"災難","s":["H6869"]},{"w":"之日","s":["H9001","H3117"]},{"w":"臨到，犯境","s":["H1464"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"之民","s":["H9001","H5971"]},{"w":"上來","s":["H9001","H5927"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"When I heard","s":["H8085"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":","},{"w":"my belly","s":["H990"]},{"w":"trembled","s":["H7264"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":";"},{"w":"my lips","s":["H8193"]},{"w":"quivered","s":["H6750"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"at the voice","s":["H6963"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"rottenness","s":["H7538"]},{"w":"entered","s":["H935"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"into my bones","s":["H6106"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and I trembled","s":["H7264"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"in myself, that I might rest","s":["H5117"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"in the day","s":["H3117"]},{"w":"of trouble","s":["H6869"]},{"w":":"},{"w":"when he cometh up","s":["H5927"],"m":["8800"]},{"w":"unto the people","s":["H5971"]},{"w":","},{"w":"he will invade them with his troops","s":["H1464"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"שָׁמַ֣עְתִּי","s":["H8085"]},{"w":"׀ וַתִּרְגַּ֣ז","s":["H7264"]},{"w":"בִּטְנִ֗י","s":["H990"]},{"w":"לְקוֹל֙","s":["H6963"]},{"w":"צָלֲל֣וּ","s":["H6750"]},{"w":"שְׂפָתַ֔י","s":["H8193"]},{"w":"יָב֥וֹא","s":["H935"]},{"w":"רָקָ֛ב","s":["H7538"]},{"w":"בַּעֲצָמַ֖י","s":["H6106"]},{"w":"וְתַחְתַּ֣י","s":["H8478"]},{"w":"אֶרְגָּ֑ז","s":["H7264"]},{"w":"אֲשֶׁ֤ר","s":["H834"]},{"w":"אָנ֨וּחַ֙","s":["H5117"]},{"w":"לְי֣וֹם","s":["H3117"]},{"w":"צָרָ֔ה","s":["H6869"]},{"w":"לַעֲל֖וֹת","s":["H5927"]},{"w":"לְעַ֥ם","s":["H5971"]},{"w":"יְגוּדֶֽנּוּ","s":["H1464"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["invade...: or, cut them in pieces"]}},{"s":17,"t":{"zh_unv":"雖然無花果樹不發旺，葡萄樹不結果，橄欖樹也不效力，田地不出糧食，圈中絕了羊，棚內也沒有牛；","en_kjv":"Although the fig tree shall not blossom, neither shall fruit be in the vines; the labour of the olive shall fail, and the fields shall yield no meat; the flock shall be cut off from the fold, and there shall be no herd in the stalls:","en_web":"For though the fig tree doesn't flourish, Nor fruit be in the vines; The labor of the olive fails, The fields yield no food; The flocks are cut off from the fold, And there is no herd in the stalls:","es_rvr1909":"Aunque la higuera no florecerá, ni en las vides habrá frutos; mentirá la obra de la oliva, y los labrados no darán mantenimiento, y las ovejas serán quitadas de la majada, y no habrá vacas en los corrales;","es_rvc":"Aunque todavía no florece la higuera, ni hay uvas en los viñedos, ni hay tampoco aceitunas en los olivos, ni los campos han rendido sus cosechas; aunque no hay ovejas en los rediles ni vacas en los corrales,","fr_nbs":"Car le figuier ne fleurira pas ; pas de vendange dans les vignes ; la production de l’olivier sera décevante, les champs ne donneront pas de nourriture, le petit bétail disparaîtra de l’enclos ; pas de gros bétail dans les étables.","ja_jp":"いちじくの木は花咲かず、ぶどうの木は実らず、オリブの木の産はむなしくなり、田畑は食物を生ぜず、おりには羊が絶え、牛舎には牛がいなくなる。","ko_kor":"비록 무화과나무가 무성치 못하며, 포도나무에 열매가 없으며, 감람나무에 소출이 없으며, 밭에 식물이 없으며, 우리에 양이 없으며, 외양간에 소가 없을지라도","vi_vie":"Vì dầu cây vả sẽ không nứt lộc nữa, Và sẽ không có trái trên những cây nho; Cây ô-li-ve không sanh sản, đồ ăn; Bầy chiên sẽ bị dứt khỏi ràn, Và không có bầy bò trong chuồng nữa.","he_wlc":"כִּֽי ־ תְאֵנָ֣ה לֹֽא ־ תִפְרָ֗ח וְאֵ֤ין יְבוּל֙ בַּגְּפָנִ֔ים כִּחֵשׁ֙ מַעֲשֵׂה ־ זַ֔יִת וּשְׁדֵמ֖וֹת לֹא ־ עָ֣שָׂה אֹ֑כֶל גָּזַ֤ר מִמִּכְלָה֙ צֹ֔אן וְאֵ֥ין בָּקָ֖ר בָּרְפָתִֽים ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"雖然","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"無花果樹","s":["H8384"]},{"w":"不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"發旺","s":["H6524"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"葡萄樹","s":["H9002","H1612"]},{"w":"不","s":["H369"]},{"w":"結果","s":["H2981"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"橄欖樹","s":["H2132"]},{"w":"也不","s":["H3584"],"m":["8765"]},{"w":"效力","s":["H4639"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"田地","s":["H7709"]},{"w":"不","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"出","s":["H6213"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"糧食","s":["H400"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"圈中","s":["H4480","H4356"]},{"w":"絕了","s":["H1504"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"羊","s":["H6629"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"棚內","s":["H9002","H7517"]},{"w":"也沒有","s":["H369"]},{"w":"牛","s":["H1241"]},{"w":"；"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Although the fig tree","s":["H8384"]},{"w":"shall not blossom","s":["H6524"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":","},{"w":"neither shall fruit","s":["H2981"]},{"w":"be in the vines","s":["H1612"],"i":1},{"w":";"},{"w":"the labour","s":["H4639"]},{"w":"of the olive","s":["H2132"]},{"w":"shall fail","s":["H3584"],"m":["8765"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and the fields","s":["H7709"]},{"w":"shall yield","s":["H6213"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"no meat","s":["H400"]},{"w":";"},{"w":"the flock","s":["H6629"]},{"w":"shall be cut off","s":["H1504"],"m":["8804"]},{"w":"from the fold","s":["H4356"]},{"w":","},{"w":"and there shall be no herd","s":["H1241"]},{"w":"in the stalls","s":["H7517"]},{"w":":"}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"כִּֽי","s":["H3588"]},{"w":"־ תְאֵנָ֣ה","s":["H8384"]},{"w":"לֹֽא","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"־ תִפְרָ֗ח","s":["H6524"]},{"w":"וְאֵ֤ין","s":["H369"]},{"w":"יְבוּל֙","s":["H2981"]},{"w":"בַּגְּפָנִ֔ים","s":["H1612"]},{"w":"כִּחֵשׁ֙","s":["H3584"]},{"w":"מַעֲשֵׂה","s":["H4639"]},{"w":"־ זַ֔יִת","s":["H2132"]},{"w":"וּשְׁדֵמ֖וֹת","s":["H7709"]},{"w":"לֹא","s":["H3808"]},{"w":"־ עָ֣שָׂה","s":["H6213"]},{"w":"אֹ֑כֶל","s":["H400"]},{"w":"גָּזַ֤ר","s":["H1504"]},{"w":"מִמִּכְלָה֙","s":["H4356"]},{"w":"צֹ֔אן","s":["H6629"]},{"w":"וְאֵ֥ין","s":["H369"]},{"w":"בָּקָ֖ר","s":["H1241"]},{"w":"בָּרְפָתִֽים","s":["H7517"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["fail: Heb. lie"]}},{"s":18,"t":{"zh_unv":"然而，我要因耶和華歡欣，因救我的　神喜樂。","en_kjv":"Yet I will rejoice in the LORD, I will joy in the God of my salvation.","en_web":"Yet I will rejoice in Yahweh. I will be joyful in the God of my salvation!","es_rvr1909":"Con todo, yo me alegraré en Jehová, y me gozaré en el Dios de mi salud.","es_rvc":"yo me alegro por ti, Señor; ¡me regocijo en ti, Dios de mi salvación!","fr_nbs":"Mais moi, j’exulterai dans le SEIGNEUR, je trouverai de l’allégresse dans le Dieu de mon salut.","ja_jp":"しかし、わたしは主によって楽しみ、わが救の神によって喜ぶ。","ko_kor":"나는 여호와를 인하여 즐거워하며 나의 구원의 하나님을 인하여 기뻐하리로다 !","vi_vie":"Dầu vậy, tôi sẽ vui mừng trong Đức Giê-hô-va, Tôi sẽ hớn hở trong Đức Chúa Trời của sự cứu rỗi tôi.","he_wlc":"וַאֲנִ֖י בַּיהוָ֣ה אֶעְל֑וֹזָה אָגִ֖ילָה בֵּאלֹהֵ֥י יִשְׁעִֽי ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"然而，我","s":["H589"]},{"w":"要因耶和華","s":["H9002","H3068"]},{"w":"歡欣","s":["H5937"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"因救","s":["H3468"]},{"w":"我的　神","s":["H9002","H430"]},{"w":"喜樂","s":["H1523"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"Yet I will rejoice","s":["H5937"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"in the LORD","s":["H3068"]},{"w":","},{"w":"I will joy","s":["H1523"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"in the God","s":["H430"]},{"w":"of my salvation","s":["H3468"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"וַאֲנִ֖י","s":["H589"]},{"w":"בַּיהוָ֣ה","s":["H3068"]},{"w":"אֶעְל֑וֹזָה","s":["H5937"]},{"w":"אָגִ֖ילָה","s":["H1523"]},{"w":"בֵּאלֹהֵ֥י","s":["H430"]},{"w":"יִשְׁעִֽי","s":["H3468"]},{"w":"׃"}]}},{"s":19,"t":{"zh_unv":"主耶和華是我的力量；他使我的腳快如母鹿的蹄，又使我穩行在高處。這歌交與伶長，用絲弦的樂器。","en_kjv":"The LORD God is my strength, and he will make my feet like hinds' feet , and he will make me to walk upon mine high places. To the chief singer on my stringed instruments.","en_web":"Yahweh, the Lord, is my strength. He makes my feet like deer's feet, And enables me to go in high places. For the music director, on my stringed instruments.","es_rvr1909":"Jehová el Señor es mi fortaleza, el cual pondrá mis pies como de ciervas, y me hará andar sobre mis alturas. Al jefe de los cantores sobre mis instrumentos de cuerdas.","es_rvc":"Tú, Señor, eres mi Dios y fortaleza. Tú, Señor, me das pies ligeros, como de cierva, y me haces andar en mis alturas.","fr_nbs":"DIEU, le Seigneur, est ma force : il rend mes pieds semblables à ceux des biches et il me fait marcher sur les hauteurs. Du chef de chœur. Avec des instruments à cordes.","ja_jp":"主なる神はわたしの力であって、わたしの足を雌じかの足のようにし、わたしに高い所を歩ませられる。","ko_kor":"주 여호와는 나의 힘이시라 ! 나의 발을 사슴과 같게 하사 나로 나의 높은 곳에 다니게 하시리로다 이 노래는 영장을 위하여 내 수금에 맞춘 것이니라","vi_vie":"Đức Giê-hô-va là Chúa, là sức mạnh của tôi, Ngài làm cho chơn tôi giống như chơn con hươu, Khiến tôi đi trên các nơi cao của mình. (Phó cho quản phường nhạc, khảy đờn mà hát bài nầy).","he_wlc":"יְהוִ֤הּ אֲדֹנָי֙ חֵילִ֔י וַיָּ֤שֶׂם רַגְלַי֙ כָּֽאַיָּל֔וֹת וְעַ֥ל בָּמוֹתַ֖י יַדְרִכֵ֑נִי לַמְנַצֵּ֖חַ בִּנְגִינוֹתָֽי ׃"},"w":{"zh_unv":[{"w":"主","s":["H136"]},{"w":"耶和華","s":["H3069"]},{"w":"是我的力量","s":["H2428"]},{"w":"；"},{"w":"他使","s":["H7760"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"我的腳","s":["H7272"]},{"w":"快如母鹿","s":["H9003","H355"]},{"w":"的蹄，又使我穩行","s":["H1869"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"在","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"高處","s":["H1116"]},{"w":"。"},{"w":"這歌交與伶長","s":["H9001","H5329"],"m":["8764"]},{"w":"，"},{"w":"用絲弦的樂器","s":["H9002","H5058"]},{"w":"。"}],"en_kjv":[{"w":"The LORD","s":["H3069"]},{"w":"God","s":["H136"]},{"w":"is my strength","s":["H2428"],"i":1},{"w":","},{"w":"and he will make","s":["H7760"],"m":["8799"]},{"w":"my feet","s":["H7272"]},{"w":"like hinds","s":["H355"]},{"w":"'"},{"w":"feet , and he will make me to walk","s":["H1869"],"m":["8686"]},{"w":"upon mine high places","s":["H1116"]},{"w":"."},{"w":"To the chief singer","s":["H5329"],"m":["8764"]},{"w":"on my stringed instruments","s":["H5058"]},{"w":"."}],"he_wlc":[{"w":"יְהוִ֤הּ","s":["H3069"]},{"w":"אֲדֹנָי֙","s":["H136"]},{"w":"חֵילִ֔י","s":["H2428"]},{"w":"וַיָּ֤שֶׂם","s":["H7760"]},{"w":"רַגְלַי֙","s":["H7272"]},{"w":"כָּֽאַיָּל֔וֹת","s":["H355"]},{"w":"וְעַ֥ל","s":["H5921"]},{"w":"בָּמוֹתַ֖י","s":["H1116"]},{"w":"יַדְרִכֵ֑נִי","s":["H1869"]},{"w":"לַמְנַצֵּ֖חַ","s":["H5329"]},{"w":"בִּנְגִינוֹתָֽי","s":["H5058"]},{"w":"׃"}]},"n":{"en_kjv":["chief...: or, overseer","stringed...: Heb. Neginoth"]},"p":1}]}]});
